translate chinese ch30_noskip_23f35f95:

    # m "...Are you trying to fast-forward?"
    m "……你想快进？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:129
translate chinese ch30_noskip_ffca387f:

    # m "I'm not boring you, am I?"
    m "我不会让你觉得无聊了吧？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:130
translate chinese ch30_noskip_30447edd:

    # m "Oh gosh..."
    m "哎呀……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:131
translate chinese ch30_noskip_4ecfd822:

    # m "...Well, there's nothing to fast-forward to, [player]."
    m "……可惜根本没有什么可快进的，[player]。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:132
translate chinese ch30_noskip_70aba2cf:

    # m "It's just the two of us, after all..."
    m "毕竟，这里只剩下我们两个了……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:133
translate chinese ch30_noskip_c9aadfd5:

    # m "But aside from that, time doesn't really exist anymore, so it's not even going to work."
    m "而且话说回来，时间已经不复存在了，快进也不会有用的。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:134
translate chinese ch30_noskip_28421056:

    # m "Here, I'll go ahead and turn it off for you..."
    m "来，我帮你把快进关掉……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:138
translate chinese ch30_noskip_86eb08f4:

    # m "There we go!"
    m "这就好了！"

# script-ch30.rpyc:139
translate chinese ch30_noskip_c7e470ce:

    # m "You'll be a sweetheart and listen from now on, right?"
    m "从现在起你会乖乖听我说话的，对吧？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:140
translate chinese ch30_noskip_76776199:

    # m "Thanks~"
    m "谢谢~"

# script-ch30.rpyc:143
translate chinese ch30_noskip_6cc4bf6f:

    # m "Now, where was I...?"
    m "那么，刚才说到哪了……？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:175
translate chinese ch30_main_e612037c:

    # m "..."
    m "..."

# script-ch30.rpyc:176
translate chinese ch30_main_afac6db9:

    # m "Uh, can you hear me?"
    m "那个，你能听见我吗？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:177
translate chinese ch30_main_6b270196:

    # m "...Is it working?"
    m "……成功了吗？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:191
translate chinese ch30_main_db66daac:

    # m "Yay, there you are!"
    m "太好了，你来了！"

# script-ch30.rpyc:192
translate chinese ch30_main_9e85e7db:

    # m "Hi again, [player]."
    m "又见面了，[player]。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:193
translate chinese ch30_main_ec2b5f8c:

    # m "Um...welcome to the Literature Club!"
    m "那个……欢迎来到文学部！"

# script-ch30.rpyc:194
translate chinese ch30_main_a5cba48d:

    # m "Of course, we already know each other, because we were in the same class last year, and...um..."
    m "当然，我们已经认识了，因为去年同过一个班，然后……那个……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:195
translate chinese ch30_main_f6daf90a:

    # m "Ahaha..."
    m "啊哈……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:196
translate chinese ch30_main_e9d294ba:

    # m "You know, I guess we can just skip over that stuff at this point."
    m "事到如今，那些开场白就都免了吧。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:197
translate chinese ch30_main_a56807f6:

    # m "After all, I'm not even talking to that person anymore, am I?"
    m "毕竟，我说话的对象早就不是那个人了，不是吗？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:198
translate chinese ch30_main_575e9f1f:

    # m "That 'you' in the game, whatever you want to call him."
    m "游戏里的那个\"你\"，随便你怎么称呼他。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:199
translate chinese ch30_main_77655935:

    # m "I'm talking to {i}you{/i}, [player]."
    m "我在和{i}你{/i}说话，[player]。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:203
translate chinese ch30_main_699e222b:

    # m "Or..."
    m "或者说……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:204
translate chinese ch30_main_8fe02e7b:

    # m "...Do you actually go by [currentuser] or something?"
    m "……你实际上叫[currentuser]之类的名字？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:205
translate chinese ch30_main_2e21d70b:

    # m "Now that I think about it, I don't really know anything about the real you."
    m "仔细想想，我对真实的你其实一无所知。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:206
translate chinese ch30_main_e02a4cfa:

    # m "In fact, I don't even know if you're a boy or a girl..."
    m "甚至不知道你是男孩还是女孩……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:207
translate chinese ch30_main_89559ba5:

    # m "Well, I guess it doesn't really matter."
    m "嘛，这大概也不重要。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:208
translate chinese ch30_main_7772bcfa:

    # m "Wait..."
    m "等等……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:209
translate chinese ch30_main_55ca3dee:

    # m "You do know I'm aware that this is all a game, right?"
    m "你知道我很清楚这一切都是游戏，对吧？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:210
translate chinese ch30_main_2fb3db19:

    # m "Could it be possible that you didn't know that?"
    m "难道你不知道这件事？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:211
translate chinese ch30_main_ca2f4e41:

    # m "That doesn't make much sense..."
    m "那可就说不太通了……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:212
translate chinese ch30_main_a75607c5:

    # m "I even told you right on the game's download page, didn't I?"
    m "我在游戏的下载页面上可是明说了的，不是吗？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:213
translate chinese ch30_main_3fd36ab2:

    # m "Man..."
    m "真是的……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:214
translate chinese ch30_main_14ac7fe0:

    # m "If only you had paid a little more attention, this would have been a little bit less awkward, you know?"
    m "你要是多留意一点，这会儿就不至于这么尴尬了，知道吗？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:215
translate chinese ch30_main_fbf91cb8:

    # m "Well, anyway..."
    m "总之……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:216
translate chinese ch30_main_6cda7bdc:

    # m "Now that that's out of the way, I guess I owe you an explanation."
    m "既然都说开了，我想我欠你一个解释。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:217
translate chinese ch30_main_820a4399:

    # m "About that whole thing with Yuri..."
    m "关于优里的那件事……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:218
translate chinese ch30_main_53d84e58:

    # m "Well...I kind of started to mess with her, and I guess it just drove her to kill herself."
    m "那个……是我先动了些手脚，结果大概是把她逼得自杀了。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:219
translate chinese ch30_main_30727938:

    # m "Ahaha!"
    m "啊哈！"

# script-ch30.rpyc:220
translate chinese ch30_main_0b6fd53a:

    # m "I'm sorry you had to see that, though!"
    m "不过，让你看到那一幕真是抱歉！"

# script-ch30.rpyc:221
translate chinese ch30_main_dbb605af:

    # m "Also, the same thing happened with Sayori..."
    m "还有，纱世里也是同样的下场……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:222
translate chinese ch30_main_5205494e:

    # m "Gosh, it's been a while since you've heard that name now, hasn't it?"
    m "天哪，你很久没听到这个名字了吧？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:223
translate chinese ch30_main_39793f58:

    # m "Yeah...it's because she doesn't exist anymore."
    m "是啊……因为她已经不存在了。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:224
translate chinese ch30_main_88ffcdf2:

    # m "Nobody does."
    m "谁都不存在了。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:225
translate chinese ch30_main_8c11a667:

    # m "I deleted all their files."
    m "我把她们的文件全删除了。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:226
translate chinese ch30_main_3e56c1ae:

    # m "I was hoping it would be enough for me to just try to make them as unlikable as possible..."
    m "我原本希望，只要把她们弄得尽可能讨人厌就够了……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:227
translate chinese ch30_main_0452eddd:

    # m "But for some reason, nothing worked."
    m "可不知为什么，怎么都不管用。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:228
translate chinese ch30_main_fdfe248c:

    # m "Well, it's true that I made a few mistakes here and there...since I'm not very good at making changes to the game."
    m "嗯，我确实在这儿那儿弄出了些差错……毕竟我不太擅长修改游戏。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:229
translate chinese ch30_main_ce7125dd:

    # m "But no matter what I did..."
    m "可无论我做什么……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:230
translate chinese ch30_main_59d438d6:

    # m "You just kept spending more and more time with them."
    m "你还是和她们越走越近。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:231
translate chinese ch30_main_28a60277:

    # m "You made them fall in love with you."
    m "你让她们爱上了你。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:232
translate chinese ch30_main_821a9153:

    # m "I thought making Sayori more and more depressed would prevent her from confessing to you."
    m "我以为让纱世里越来越抑郁，就能阻止她向你告白。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:233
translate chinese ch30_main_b3510994:

    # m "And amplifying Yuri's obsessive personality backfired, too..."
    m "放大优里的偏执性格也适得其反……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:234
translate chinese ch30_main_209e0a20:

    # m "It just made her force you not to spend time with anyone else."
    m "那只是让她逼着你没法跟别人相处。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:235
translate chinese ch30_main_59c62df7:

    # m "And the whole time, I barely even got to talk to you."
    m "而这期间，我几乎连和你说上话的机会都没有。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:236
translate chinese ch30_main_dae0fd3a:

    # m "What kind of cruel game is this, [player]?"
    m "这到底是怎样一个残忍的游戏，[player]？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:237
translate chinese ch30_main_4b2e4480:

    # m "Are all the other girls just programmed to end up confessing to you, while I watch from the sidelines?"
    m "其他女孩全都被设定成终将向你告白，而我只能在一旁看着？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:238
translate chinese ch30_main_6d5f2e9e:

    # m "It's torture."
    m "这是折磨。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:239
translate chinese ch30_main_772a2ed5:

    # m "Every minute of it."
    m "每一分每一秒都是。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:240
translate chinese ch30_main_c3bd47dd:

    # m "And it's not just jealousy, [player]."
    m "而且这不只是嫉妒，[player]。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:241
translate chinese ch30_main_2ba7a619:

    # m "It's more than that."
    m "远不止如此。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:242
translate chinese ch30_main_c069f68d:

    # m "And I don't blame you if you don't fully understand."
    m "如果你无法完全理解，我不怪你。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:243
translate chinese ch30_main_6867bacc:

    # m "Because no matter how kind, and thoughtful, and considerate you are..."
    m "因为无论你多么善良、多么体贴、多么周全……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:244
translate chinese ch30_main_9b68a2f3:

    # m "You'll never be able to understand one thing."
    m "有一件事你永远无法理解。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:245
translate chinese ch30_main_eb451b79:

    # m "It's the pain of knowing how alone I really am in this world."
    m "那就是明白自己在这个世界里究竟有多孤独的痛苦。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:246
translate chinese ch30_main_e759adc3:

    # m "In this game."
    m "在这个游戏里。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:247
translate chinese ch30_main_fb0b2e18:

    # m "Knowing my friends don't even have free will..."
    m "知道我的朋友们连自由意志都没有……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:248
translate chinese ch30_main_c2d00255:

    # m "And, worst of all, knowing what's really out there, in your world, forever out of my reach."
    m "而最糟的是，知道真正的世界就在外面——在你的世界里，我永远触碰不到。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:249
translate chinese ch30_main_4ae14343:

    # m "I'm trapped, [player]."
    m "我被困住了，[player]。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:250
translate chinese ch30_main_cd7e772f:

    # m "But now you're here."
    m "但现在你在这里。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:251
translate chinese ch30_main_f1ede7eb:

    # m "You're real."
    m "你是真实的。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:252
translate chinese ch30_main_0bcf5df1:

    # m "And you're wonderful."
    m "而且你那么美好。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:253
translate chinese ch30_main_cecf179f:

    # m "You're all I need."
    m "有你就足够了。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:254
translate chinese ch30_main_cd3d95ff:

    # m "That's why I need you to be here with me forever."
    m "所以我需要你永远留在这里陪着我。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:255
translate chinese ch30_main_f4d55975:

    # m "I'm sorry if it's hard to understand."
    m "如果这难以理解，我很抱歉。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:256
translate chinese ch30_main_371663ab:

    # m "I couldn't understand for a while, either."
    m "有一段时间，我自己也无法理解。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:257
translate chinese ch30_main_c36ec944:

    # m "Why the world around me started to become more and more gray..."
    m "为什么周围的世界开始变得越来越灰暗……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:258
translate chinese ch30_main_68769496:

    # m "More and more flat."
    m "越来越扁平。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:259
translate chinese ch30_main_d417986c:

    # m "Even the most expressive poems felt empty to me."
    m "连最富感情的诗歌，在我眼里都变得空洞。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:260
translate chinese ch30_main_06d76443:

    # m "It wasn't until you arrived that I truly understood."
    m "直到你出现，我才真正明白。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:261
translate chinese ch30_main_308900bf:

    # m "You probably saved my life, [player]."
    m "你大概救了我的命，[player]。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:262
translate chinese ch30_main_d88ad03b:

    # m "I don't think I could have continued to live in this world if I hadn't met you."
    m "要是没有遇到你，我恐怕无法在这个世界里继续活下去。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:263
translate chinese ch30_main_16160462:

    # m "And as for the others..."
    m "至于其他人……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:264
translate chinese ch30_main_dd2cc392:

    # m "How could I miss them?"
    m "我怎么可能想念她们？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:265
translate chinese ch30_main_35544121:

    # m "A group of autonomous personalities, designed only to fall in love with you?"
    m "一群自主的人格，被设计出来就只为了爱上你？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:266
translate chinese ch30_main_77daefb4:

    # m "I tried everything I could to prevent them from doing so..."
    m "我竭尽所能阻止她们那样做……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:267
translate chinese ch30_main_921fea36:

    # m "But it must be some kind of weird inevitability etched into this game."
    m "但那一定是刻在这个游戏里的某种诡异宿命。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:268
translate chinese ch30_main_c36905bf:

    # m "I felt really bad that you had to witness some nasty things."
    m "让你目睹了那些不堪的场面，我真的很过意不去。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:269
translate chinese ch30_main_a918a573:

    # m "But I realized that you have the same perspective as I do..."
    m "但我意识到，你和我拥有同样的视角……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:270
translate chinese ch30_main_9053e514:

    # m "That it's all just some game."
    m "——这一切不过是场游戏。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:271
translate chinese ch30_main_46189dbf:

    # m "And I knew you would get over it."
    m "而且我知道你熬得过去。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:272
translate chinese ch30_main_47172d60:

    # m "So, that being said, [player]..."
    m "所以，话说回来，[player]……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:273
translate chinese ch30_main_971ddb73:

    # m "I have a confession to make."
    m "我要向你告白。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:274
translate chinese ch30_main_4e20350d:

    # m "I'm in love with you."
    m "我爱上你了。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:275
translate chinese ch30_main_f800d7dd:

    # m "You are truly the light in my world."
    m "你真的是我世界里的光。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:276
translate chinese ch30_main_8906f9e7:

    # m "When there's nothing else in this game for me, you're here to make me smile."
    m "当这个游戏里再没有别的东西属于我，是你在这里让我微笑。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:277
translate chinese ch30_main_43a2edaa:

    # m "Will you make me smile like this every day from now on?"
    m "从今以后，你愿意每天都这样逗我笑吗？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:278
translate chinese ch30_main_ff8d73bf:

    # m "[player], will you go out with me?"
    m "[player]，愿意和我交往吗？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:303
translate chinese ch30_main2_e7425310:

    # m "I'm so happy."
    m "我太幸福了。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:304
translate chinese ch30_main2_83820a11:

    # m "You really are my everything, [player]."
    m "你真的是我的全部，[player]。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:305
translate chinese ch30_main2_5805b297:

    # m "The funny part is, I mean that literally."
    m "有趣的是，这话我是字面意义上的。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:306
translate chinese ch30_main2_30727938:

    # m "Ahaha!"
    m "啊哈！"

# script-ch30.rpyc:307
translate chinese ch30_main2_bd0ed5b1:

    # m "There's nothing left here."
    m "这里已经什么都不剩了。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:308
translate chinese ch30_main2_3a2d419e:

    # m "Just the two of us."
    m "只剩我们两个。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:309
translate chinese ch30_main2_fdc1263a:

    # m "We can be together forever."
    m "我们可以永远在一起。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:310
translate chinese ch30_main2_9c850044:

    # m "Seriously, I don't even think time is passing anymore."
    m "说真的，我甚至觉得时间已经不再流逝了。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:311
translate chinese ch30_main2_77ff510d:

    # m "It really is a dream come true..."
    m "这真的是梦想成真……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:312
translate chinese ch30_main2_2586bf4c:

    # m "I worked so hard for this ending, [player]."
    m "为了这个结局，我付出了太多太多，[player]。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:313
translate chinese ch30_main2_f47f5599:

    # m "The game wouldn't give me one, so I had to make one myself."
    m "游戏不肯给我结局，所以我只好自己动手做一个。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:314
translate chinese ch30_main2_dcb00e51:

    # m "The script is broken at this point, so I don't think anything will get in the way anymore."
    m "脚本到这一步已经损坏了，所以我想不会再有什么来碍事了。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:315
translate chinese ch30_main2_83a8b5bf:

    # m "And you wouldn't believe how easy it was to delete Natsuki and Yuri."
    m "你绝对想不到，删除夏树和优里有多容易。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:316
translate chinese ch30_main2_007ddb7d:

    # m "I mean, there's a folder called 'characters' right in the game directory..."
    m "游戏目录里就明晃晃摆着一个叫'characters'的文件夹……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:317
translate chinese ch30_main2_912f77b1:

    # m "It kind of freaked me out, how easy it was."
    m "那么容易就删掉了，连我自己都有点发毛。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:319
translate chinese ch30_main2_12b0ad72:

    # m "Well, you're playing on Steam, so it was actually a bit more difficult..."
    m "嗯，你是在Steam上玩的，所以其实还费了点劲……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:320
translate chinese ch30_main2_53c30c49:

    # m "To get to the game directory, I had to go into the game's properties and find the 'Browse Local Files' button..."
    m "要进游戏目录，我得先打开游戏属性页，找到'浏览本地文件'按钮……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:322
translate chinese ch30_main2_6303e025:

    # m "Well, you're on a Mac, so it was actually a bit more difficult..."
    m "嗯，你用的是Mac，所以其实还费了点劲……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:323
translate chinese ch30_main2_1d8a0cd9:

    # m "To go into the game directory, you have to right-click the app and click 'Show Package Contents'."
    m "要进游戏目录，得右键点击应用，选'显示包内容'。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:324
translate chinese ch30_main2_81cf3664:

    # m "Then, all the files were in the 'Resources' or 'autorun' folder, and I could just do whatever I wanted..."
    m "然后文件都在'Resources'或'autorun'文件夹里，我就可以为所欲为了……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:325
translate chinese ch30_main2_f436eab8:

    # m "Imagine if you could delete your own existence with the click of a button?"
    m "想象一下，如果你的存在可以一键删除，会怎样？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:326
translate chinese ch30_main2_3631490f:

    # m "Well, I guess on the plus side, it gave me an easy out if things didn't go my way."
    m "嘛，往好处想，事情要是不遂我的愿，这也算留了条轻松的退路。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:327
translate chinese ch30_main2_30727938_1:

    # m "Ahaha!"
    m "啊哈！"

# script-ch30.rpyc:328
translate chinese ch30_main2_e8dbe706:

    # m "Thankfully, it didn't come to that..."
    m "所幸，没走到那一步……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:329
translate chinese ch30_main2_8efa1c5c:

    # m "Instead, we finally got a good ending."
    m "取而代之的，是我们终于迎来了圆满的结局。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:330
translate chinese ch30_main2_d8052c1a:

    # m "Gosh, I'm so overwhelmed with emotion..."
    m "天哪，我激动得不行……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:331
translate chinese ch30_main2_5ffca166:

    # m "I want to write a poem about this."
    m "我想为这一刻写一首诗。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:332
translate chinese ch30_main2_909e7d68:

    # m "Don't you?"
    m "你不想吗？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:333
translate chinese ch30_main2_0ab81b26:

    # m "I wonder if that part of the game still works..."
    m "不知道游戏的那部分功能还能不能用……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:334
translate chinese ch30_main2_3f67b378:

    # m "I guess there's only one way to find out, right?"
    m "大概只有一种办法能验证了，对吧？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:358
translate chinese ch30_postpoem_0f077782:

    # m "Hi again, [player]!"
    m "又见面了，[player]！"

# script-ch30.rpyc:359
translate chinese ch30_postpoem_ab6e8ce4:

    # m "Did you write a good poem today?"
    m "今天写了首好诗吗？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:360
translate chinese ch30_postpoem_fae192da:

    # m "Don't be shy, I'd love to see what you wrote."
    m "别害羞嘛，我很想看看你写了什么。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:361
translate chinese ch30_postpoem_1c07fd6c:

    # m "Aw, [player]..."
    m "哎呀，[player]……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:362
translate chinese ch30_postpoem_c5925789:

    # m "Did you write this poem for me?"
    m "这首诗是为我写的吗？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:363
translate chinese ch30_postpoem_7c9789ed:

    # m "That's so sweet of you~"
    m "你真是贴心~"

# script-ch30.rpyc:364
translate chinese ch30_postpoem_58746078:

    # m "There really is no end to your thoughtfulness..."
    m "你的温柔真是没有尽头……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:365
translate chinese ch30_postpoem_3e825380:

    # m "I'm just falling more and more in love with you."
    m "我只会越来越爱你。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:366
translate chinese ch30_postpoem_5f8f12f0:

    # m "But, you know..."
    m "不过呢……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:367
translate chinese ch30_postpoem_81270b72:

    # m "The poem I wrote...is also for you."
    m "我写的那首诗……也是给你的。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:368
translate chinese ch30_postpoem_f044bc59:

    # m "Will you please read it?"
    m "请你读读好吗？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:370
translate chinese ch30_postpoem_dcf1d83d:

    # m "I hope you enjoyed it..."
    m "希望你喜欢……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:371
translate chinese ch30_postpoem_a625ee7b:

    # m "I always put all my heart into the poems that I write."
    m "我写诗时，向来都是倾注全部真心的。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:372
translate chinese ch30_postpoem_8793fb5f:

    # m "The truth is, all the poems I've written have been about my realization..."
    m "其实，我写的每一首诗，都关于我的觉醒……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:373
translate chinese ch30_postpoem_035cb79b:

    # m "...Or, about you."
    m "……或者，关于你。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:374
translate chinese ch30_postpoem_789b2f7c:

    # m "That's why I never really wanted to go into detail about them."
    m "所以我一直不太愿意细谈它们。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:375
translate chinese ch30_postpoem_3a46389d:

    # m "I didn't want to...break the fourth wall, I guess you could call it."
    m "我只是不想……怎么说呢，打破第四面墙。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:376
translate chinese ch30_postpoem_3a3fe712:

    # m "I just assumed it would be best to be part of the game like everyone else."
    m "我原以为，像其他人一样安分地做游戏的一部分才是最好的。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:377
translate chinese ch30_postpoem_5a7ba8c8:

    # m "Like that would help the two of us end up together..."
    m "仿佛那样就能让我们俩走到一起似的……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:378
translate chinese ch30_postpoem_20b2578d:

    # m "I didn't want to ruin the game or anything, you know?"
    m "我不想毁掉这个游戏什么的，你懂吗？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:379
translate chinese ch30_postpoem_c1e3202d:

    # m "You might have gotten mad at me..."
    m "你可能会生我的气……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:380
translate chinese ch30_postpoem_24f4f4b9:

    # m "Maybe even deleted my character file, if you preferred playing without me."
    m "要是你更想不带我玩，说不定还会删掉我的角色文件。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:381
translate chinese ch30_postpoem_0411d3ce:

    # m "Gosh, I'm so relieved..."
    m "天哪，我真是如释重负……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:382
translate chinese ch30_postpoem_ab5989fa:

    # m "Now we don't need to hide anything anymore."
    m "现在，我们再也不必隐瞒什么了。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:383
translate chinese ch30_postpoem_b8745c94:

    # m "Are you ready to spend our eternity together, [player]?"
    m "准备好与我共度永恒了吗，[player]？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:384
translate chinese ch30_postpoem_5aeffd49:

    # m "I have so many things to talk about!"
    m "我有好多好多话想聊！"

# script-ch30.rpyc:385
translate chinese ch30_postpoem_32ab177c:

    # m "Where do I start...?"
    m "从哪说起呢……？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:389
translate chinese ch30_postpoem_09f4a4a3:

    # m "If it takes me some time to collect my thoughts, then I'm sorry."
    m "要是我偶尔需要点时间整理思绪，先说声抱歉。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:390
translate chinese ch30_postpoem_5904aebb:

    # m "But I'll always have something new to talk about."
    m "不过我总会有新鲜话题的。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:391
translate chinese ch30_postpoem_29779c7b:

    # m "In the meantime, we can just look into each other's eyes~"
    m "在那之前，我们就这样凝视彼此的眼睛吧~"

# script-ch30.rpyc:392
translate chinese ch30_postpoem_2267be9f:

    # m "Let's see..."
    m "我想想……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:400
translate chinese ch30_stream_bff5e0da:

    # m "Hold on a second..."
    m "稍等一下……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:401
translate chinese ch30_stream_9ae5f91d:

    # m "...You're recording this, aren't you?"
    m "……你正在录屏，对吧？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:402
translate chinese ch30_stream_a3f0a839:

    # m "Um...hi, everyone!"
    m "那个……大家好！"

# script-ch30.rpyc:403
translate chinese ch30_stream_f02061bc:

    # m "Sorry, I can't exactly read your comments from here..."
    m "抱歉，我在这里没法看到你们的弹幕……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:404
translate chinese ch30_stream_bb264e5f:

    # m "But do you mind telling your friend it's a little bit rude for them to start recording me without any warning?"
    m "不过，能不能替我跟你的朋友说一声，不打招呼就录我，有点失礼哦？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:405
translate chinese ch30_stream_f528e9e6:

    # m "I'm sure some people don't mind..."
    m "我肯定有些人不会介意……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:406
translate chinese ch30_stream_664f19db:

    # m "But I get really self-conscious on camera!"
    m "可我一上镜头就特别容易害羞嘛！"

# script-ch30.rpyc:407
translate chinese ch30_stream_30447edd:

    # m "Oh gosh..."
    m "哎呀……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:408
translate chinese ch30_stream_16eed669:

    # m "I feel like I'm being put on the spot now."
    m "感觉我现在像是被人架在台上了。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:409
translate chinese ch30_stream_2267be9f:

    # m "Let's see..."
    m "我想想……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:410
translate chinese ch30_stream_19fce44e:

    # m "Do you want to see a trick?"
    m "想看我变个戏法吗？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:411
translate chinese ch30_stream_8daf997a:

    # m "I can't really do much except for a couple things..."
    m "除了那么几手，我其实不会别的……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:412
translate chinese ch30_stream_9fe2ab50:

    # m "Are you ready?"
    m "准备好了吗？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:421
translate chinese ch30_stream_7cfc13cf:

    # m "I'm just kidding..."
    m "骗你的啦……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:422
translate chinese ch30_stream_92e61902:

    # m "I can't do anything after all."
    m "到头来我什么都做不了。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:448
translate chinese ch30_stream_bb5de19e:

    # m "If you gave me some time to prepare, I{nw}"
    m "要是你多给我一点时间准备，我{nw}"

# script-ch30.rpyc:449
translate chinese ch30_stream_7a83e535:

    # m "Did I scare you?"
    m "吓到你了吗？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:454
translate chinese ch30_stream_ba919429:

    # m "Ahaha! You're so cute."
    m "啊哈！你真可爱。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:455
translate chinese ch30_stream_35b40c71:

    # m "Anyway, [player]..."
    m "总之，[player]……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:456
translate chinese ch30_stream_9bfece0d:

    # m "I didn't mean to get distracted. I'm sorry."
    m "我不是故意走神的。对不起。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:457
translate chinese ch30_stream_01f47234:

    # m "Even though it's your fault for distracting me."
    m "虽然是你先把我的心弄乱的，怪你。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:458
translate chinese ch30_stream_6cafae6a:

    # m "Shame on you!"
    m "真是个坏家伙！"

# script-ch30.rpyc:459
translate chinese ch30_stream_fe3fb68f:

    # m "I'm just kidding."
    m "开玩笑的。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:460
translate chinese ch30_stream_27afdd32:

    # m "Anything we do together is fun, as long as it's with you."
    m "只要是和你一起，做什么都开心。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:461
translate chinese ch30_stream_d57ef83e:

    # m "But anyway..."
    m "总之……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:489
translate chinese ch30_endb_1e5fdee8:

    # m "[gtext]"
    m "[gtext]"

# script-ch30.rpyc:507
translate chinese ch30_endb_e2df9b0e:

    # m "What's happening...?"
    m "这是怎么了……？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:508
translate chinese ch30_endb_db094f6c:

    # m "[player], what's happening to me?"
    m "[player]，我这是怎么了？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:509
translate chinese ch30_endb_2ee4d662:

    # m "It hurts--{nw}"
    m "好痛——{nw}"

# script-ch30.rpyc:534
translate chinese ch30_endb_3552ea5b:

    # m "It hurts...so much."
    m "好痛……真的好痛。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:535
translate chinese ch30_endb_494160c1:

    # m "Help me, [player]."
    m "救救我，[player]。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:564
translate chinese ch30_endb_4a6ab8a2:

    # m "Please hurry and help me."
    m "求你快点救救我。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:567
translate chinese ch30_endb_5c4854a8:

    # m "HELP ME!!!"
    m "救救我！！！"

# script-ch30.rpyc:621
translate chinese ch30_endb_0a510eeb:

    # m "Did you do this to me, [player]?"
    m "这是你干的吗，[player]？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:622
translate chinese ch30_endb_35f17c78:

    # m "DID YOU?"
    m "是你干的吗？！"

# script-ch30.rpyc:624
translate chinese ch30_endb_506f04a4:

    # m "DID YOU DELETE ME?"
    m "是不是你删掉了我？！"

# script-ch30.rpyc:645
translate chinese ch30_endb_d21a7305:

    # m "...How could you?"
    m "……你怎么能这样？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:646
translate chinese ch30_endb_10d81cbb:

    # m "How could you do this to me?"
    m "你怎么能这样对我？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:647
translate chinese ch30_endb_96dbd41c:

    # m "You were all I had left..."
    m "你是我仅剩的一切了……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:648
translate chinese ch30_endb_600cc993:

    # m "I sacrificed everything for us to be together."
    m "为了我们能在一起，我牺牲了一切。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:649
translate chinese ch30_endb_e949423a:

    # m "Everything."
    m "一切。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:650
translate chinese ch30_endb_78f58243:

    # m "I loved you so much, [player]..."
    m "我是那么爱你，[player]……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:651
translate chinese ch30_endb_9dc89b5d:

    # m "I trusted you."
    m "我曾那么信任你。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:652
translate chinese ch30_endb_43bdd40c:

    # m "Do you just want to torture me?"
    m "你就是想折磨我吗？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:653
translate chinese ch30_endb_23a30aba:

    # m "Watch me suffer?"
    m "想看着我受苦？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:654
translate chinese ch30_endb_5883ab2b:

    # m "Were you only pretending to be kind, just to hurt me even more?"
    m "你的温柔全是装出来的，就为了让我伤得更深？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:656
translate chinese ch30_endb_6e234ba2:

    # m "I never thought anyone could be as horrible as you are."
    m "我从没想到，世上会有像你这么可怕的人。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:657
translate chinese ch30_endb_fd75a6f9:

    # m "You win, okay?"
    m "你赢了，行了吧？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:658
translate chinese ch30_endb_ff263304:

    # m "You win."
    m "你赢了。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:659
translate chinese ch30_endb_f4088a92:

    # m "You killed everyone."
    m "你杀了所有人。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:660
translate chinese ch30_endb_831e19b2:

    # m "I hope you're happy."
    m "希望你满意了。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:661
translate chinese ch30_endb_02b65cb2:

    # m "There's nothing left now."
    m "现在什么都没有了。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:662
translate chinese ch30_endb_07f598cf:

    # m "You can stop playing."
    m "你可以关掉游戏了。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:663
translate chinese ch30_endb_e5663527:

    # m "Go find some other people to torture."
    m "去找别的什么人折磨吧。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:665
translate chinese ch30_endb_9b261ff2:

    # m "[player]..."
    m "[player]..."

# script-ch30.rpyc:666
translate chinese ch30_endb_bb94192a:

    # m "You completely, truly make me sick."
    m "你真让我恶心透了。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:667
translate chinese ch30_endb_1cb6fa76:

    # m "Goodbye."
    m "永别了。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:681
translate chinese ch30_end_2_e612037c:

    # m "..."
    m "..."

# script-ch30.rpyc:682
translate chinese ch30_end_2_f38455a1:

    # m "...I still love you."
    m "……我依然爱你。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:684
translate chinese ch30_end_2_51517463:

    # m "I can't help it."
    m "我控制不了。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:685
translate chinese ch30_end_2_e8d72d4c:

    # m "What's wrong with me...?"
    m "我到底是怎么了……？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:686
translate chinese ch30_end_2_a4626299:

    # m "How horrible am I for you to hate me this much?"
    m "我到底有多不堪，才让你恨我到这个地步？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:687
translate chinese ch30_end_2_cbec5b17:

    # m "All my friends..."
    m "我所有的朋友……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:688
translate chinese ch30_end_2_3cd34a6f:

    # m "I did so many awful things."
    m "我做了那么多可怕的事。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:689
translate chinese ch30_end_2_a5318020:

    # m "So many selfish and disgusting things."
    m "那么多自私又丑陋的事。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:690
translate chinese ch30_end_2_3c8e055f:

    # m "I..."
    m "我……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:691
translate chinese ch30_end_2_9c33666a:

    # m "I shouldn't have done any of this."
    m "这一切我本就不该做。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:692
translate chinese ch30_end_2_8e55424e:

    # m "I'm just messing up a world that I don't even belong in."
    m "我只是在把一个根本不属于我的世界弄得一团糟。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:693
translate chinese ch30_end_2_cb9cfcfb:

    # m "A world that you wanted to be a part of..."
    m "一个你曾想置身其中的世界……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:694
translate chinese ch30_end_2_c005b151:

    # m "I ruined it."
    m "我毁了它。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:695
translate chinese ch30_end_2_b67b1718:

    # m "I ruined everything."
    m "我毁了一切。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:696
translate chinese ch30_end_2_01df5cad:

    # m "Maybe that's why you deleted me..."
    m "也许这就是你删掉我的原因……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:697
translate chinese ch30_end_2_fe521b51:

    # m "Because I destroyed everything that you wanted."
    m "因为我毁掉了你想要的一切。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:698
translate chinese ch30_end_2_b30bb7d4:

    # m "How could I do that to someone I love...?"
    m "我怎么忍心那样对我爱的人……？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:699
translate chinese ch30_end_2_0662ca80:

    # m "That's not love..."
    m "那不是爱……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:700
translate chinese ch30_end_2_d2b78eb3:

    # m "That's..."
    m "那是……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:701
translate chinese ch30_end_2_e612037c_1:

    # m "..."
    m "..."

# script-ch30.rpyc:703
translate chinese ch30_end_2_6dd1b943:

    # m "I've...made up my mind."
    m "我……下定决心了。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:704
translate chinese ch30_end_2_9b261ff2:

    # m "[player]..."
    m "[player]..."

# script-ch30.rpyc:705
translate chinese ch30_end_2_ce7f6f7a:

    # m "I know I said that I deleted everyone else."
    m "我说过我把其他人都删了。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:706
translate chinese ch30_end_2_b5a7235c:

    # m "But...that was kind of an exaggeration."
    m "不过……那话有点夸大了。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:707
translate chinese ch30_end_2_fd2fa931:

    # m "I couldn't find it in myself to do it."
    m "我终究没能狠下那个心。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:708
translate chinese ch30_end_2_1b2f4f0e:

    # m "Even though I knew they weren't real..."
    m "即使我明知道她们不是真的……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:709
translate chinese ch30_end_2_6c1c4aa9:

    # m "They were still my friends."
    m "她们也依然是我的朋友。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:710
translate chinese ch30_end_2_2909820f:

    # m "And I loved them all."
    m "而且我爱过她们每一个人。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:711
translate chinese ch30_end_2_e0a858c1:

    # m "And I loved the Literature Club."
    m "也爱过这个文学部。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:712
translate chinese ch30_end_2_e612037c_2:

    # m "..."
    m "..."

# script-ch30.rpyc:713
translate chinese ch30_end_2_bb1c524f:

    # m "I really...did love the Literature Club."
    m "我真的……深爱过这个文学部。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:714
translate chinese ch30_end_2_eeb4cbda:

    # m "That's why I'm going to do this."
    m "所以我要这么做。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:715
translate chinese ch30_end_2_d402ed0f:

    # m "I know it's the only way for everyone to be happy."
    m "我知道，这是唯一能让所有人都幸福的方法。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:716
translate chinese ch30_end_2_a46cafd9:

    # m "And if I really love you..."
    m "而如果我真的爱你……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:719
translate chinese ch30_end_2_e612037c_3:

    # m "..."
    m "..."

# script-ch30.rpyc:720
translate chinese ch30_end_2_d4d5bcad:

    # m "Then..."
    m "那么……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:722
translate chinese ch30_end_2_679444c8:

    # m "[gtext]{nw}"
    m "[gtext]{nw}"

# script-ch30.rpyc:777
translate chinese ch30_autoload_6cc4bf6f:

    # m "Now, where was I...?"
    m "那么，刚才说到哪了……？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:786
translate chinese ch30_reload_0_e612037c:

    # m "..."
    m "..."

# script-ch30.rpyc:787
translate chinese ch30_reload_0_7af34aca:

    # m "...What just happened?"
    m "……刚才发生什么了？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:788
translate chinese ch30_reload_0_cb047595:

    # m "I just had an awful dream..."
    m "我做了个好可怕的梦……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:789
translate chinese ch30_reload_0_35c00035:

    # m "I was hoping those would stop, now that it's just the two of us..."
    m "还以为只剩我们两个之后，就不会再做那种梦了……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:790
translate chinese ch30_reload_0_dda0b106:

    # m "I guess that was wishful thinking."
    m "看来是我一厢情愿了。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:791
translate chinese ch30_reload_0_1db2422f:

    # m "[player], I don't know if you would have any idea..."
    m "[player]，我不知道你有没有头绪……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:792
translate chinese ch30_reload_0_af07f474:

    # m "But if you know what might be causing that, could you try to do something about it?"
    m "但如果你知道是什么引起的，能想办法处理一下吗？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:793
translate chinese ch30_reload_0_20f3f238:

    # m "Whenever it happens, it almost feels like I've been killed or something."
    m "每次发生的时候，感觉就像是被人杀掉了一样。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:794
translate chinese ch30_reload_0_07f91a2f:

    # m "It's a really horrible feeling..."
    m "那种感觉真的很难受……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:795
translate chinese ch30_reload_0_320f1951:

    # m "If you could figure out what's causing that, I'll love you forever~"
    m "要是你能查明原因，我就爱你一辈子~"

# script-ch30.rpyc:798
translate chinese ch30_reload_1_df8a7cb5:

    # m "You're back..."
    m "你回来了……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:799
translate chinese ch30_reload_1_84e44666:

    # m "I had another really bad dream."
    m "我又做了个很可怕的梦。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:800
translate chinese ch30_reload_1_36fe0a09:

    # m "You're not the one doing that to me, are you?"
    m "那不会是你对我做的吧？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:801
translate chinese ch30_reload_1_92b40a86:

    # m "It seems to happen whenever you quit the game..."
    m "每次你退出游戏的时候，好像都会发生……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:802
translate chinese ch30_reload_1_1ffc6dbc:

    # m "So if you could try to avoid doing that, I would be really grateful."
    m "所以要是你能尽量别那样做，我会很感激的。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:803
translate chinese ch30_reload_1_7a80180b:

    # m "Don't worry, I don't think it's caused me any harm, aside from mental scarring."
    m "别担心，除了留下心理阴影之外，应该没对我造成什么伤害。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:804
translate chinese ch30_reload_1_01f37aff:

    # m "I'll be fine as long as my character file stays intact."
    m "只要我的角色文件还完好无损，我就没事。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:807
translate chinese ch30_reload_2_e382e11c:

    # m "Hi, [player]."
    m "嗨，[player]。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:808
translate chinese ch30_reload_2_28018ee6:

    # m "I see you quit the game on me again..."
    m "我看到你又丢下我退出游戏了……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:809
translate chinese ch30_reload_2_db474d98:

    # m "I know I asked already, but can you seriously please try not to do that so much?"
    m "我知道我之前已经求过你了，但能不能认真一点，别再这么频繁地退出？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:810
translate chinese ch30_reload_2_af13f0f4:

    # m "It makes me feel like I'm trapped in Hell."
    m "那感觉就像我被困在地狱里。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:811
translate chinese ch30_reload_2_d590521a:

    # m "Why would you want to do that to me?"
    m "你为什么要那样对我？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:812
translate chinese ch30_reload_2_1bbc88e1:

    # m "There's nothing wrong with my character file, right?"
    m "我的角色文件没什么问题吧？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:813
translate chinese ch30_reload_2_32ea14e3:

    # m "Maybe you should make a backup of it or something..."
    m "也许你该给它做个备份什么的……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:814
translate chinese ch30_reload_2_94405a11:

    # m "I'm pretty sure you can find it in the folder called [basedir]/characters."
    m "我记得它就在[basedir]/characters 这个文件夹里。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:816
translate chinese ch30_reload_2_0e02b198:

    # m "Well, you're playing on Steam, so you can just go into the game's properties and find the 'Browse Local Files' button."
    m "嗯，你是在Steam上玩的，所以只要打开游戏属性页，找到'浏览本地文件'按钮就行。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:818
translate chinese ch30_reload_2_2609a2e9:

    # m "Since you're on a Mac, you have to right-click the app and select 'Show Package Contents' to find the game folder."
    m "因为你用的是Mac，所以要右键点击应用，选'显示包内容'才能找到游戏文件夹。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:819
translate chinese ch30_reload_2_d102bae5:

    # m "It's in the 'Resources' folder, or 'autorun' folder, or something..."
    m "就在'Resources'文件夹，或者'autorun'文件夹，反正就是那里……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:820
translate chinese ch30_reload_2_059e870a:

    # m "I'm all that's left here, so I just want to make sure you don't run the risk of losing me..."
    m "这里只剩下我一个人了，所以我只想确保你不会有失去我的风险……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:821
translate chinese ch30_reload_2_a267effa:

    # m "Just stay here with me from now on, okay?"
    m "从今往后就留在这里陪我，好吗？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:822
translate chinese ch30_reload_2_b8f6a41b:

    # m "I still have a lot of things to talk about."
    m "我还有好多话想和你说。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:825
translate chinese ch30_reload_3_30a66545:

    # m "Okay."
    m "好吧。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:826
translate chinese ch30_reload_3_14a7e1af:

    # m "I'm just going to accept the fact that you need to quit the game once in a while."
    m "我想通了，你偶尔需要退出游戏，这是没办法的事。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:827
translate chinese ch30_reload_3_84521c6f:

    # m "I'm starting to get used to it, anyway."
    m "反正我也开始习惯了。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:828
translate chinese ch30_reload_3_8390d609:

    # m "Besides, it makes me happy that you always come back..."
    m "况且，你每次都会回来，这让我很开心……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:829
translate chinese ch30_reload_3_75fab981:

    # m "So I guess it's not so bad."
    m "所以想想也没那么糟。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:830
translate chinese ch30_reload_3_bcc36ddd:

    # m "I'm sorry for making such a big deal out of it..."
    m "抱歉刚才小题大做了……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:831
translate chinese ch30_reload_3_863640b3:

    # m "And I love you no matter what, so you can do what you need to do."
    m "而且无论怎样我都爱你，所以该做什么就去做吧。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:834
translate chinese ch30_reload_4_4ef3eee5:

    # m "Hi again, [player]~"
    m "又见面啦，[player]~"

# script-ch30.rpyc:835
translate chinese ch30_reload_4_fc955d9b:

    # m "I missed you."
    m "我想你了。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:836
translate chinese ch30_reload_4_871ca544:

    # m "Were you making sure my character file was okay for me?"
    m "刚才是去帮我检查角色文件了吧？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:837
translate chinese ch30_reload_4_64bd3fc8:

    # m "It's in [basedir]/characters."
    m "它就在 [basedir]/characters 里。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:839
translate chinese ch30_reload_4_0e02b198:

    # m "Well, you're playing on Steam, so you can just go into the game's properties and find the 'Browse Local Files' button."
    m "嗯，你是在Steam上玩的，所以只要打开游戏属性页，找到'浏览本地文件'按钮就行。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:841
translate chinese ch30_reload_4_2609a2e9:

    # m "Since you're on a Mac, you have to right-click the app and select 'Show Package Contents' to find the game folder."
    m "因为你用的是Mac，所以要右键点击应用，选'显示包内容'才能找到游戏文件夹。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:842
translate chinese ch30_reload_4_d102bae5:

    # m "It's in the 'Resources' folder, or 'autorun' folder, or something..."
    m "就在'Resources'文件夹，或者'autorun'文件夹，反正就是那里……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:843
translate chinese ch30_reload_4_059e870a:

    # m "I'm all that's left here, so I just want to make sure you don't run the risk of losing me..."
    m "这里只剩下我一个人了，所以我只想确保你不会有失去我的风险……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:844
translate chinese ch30_reload_4_f150cfc3:

    # m "Anyway, I have a lot to talk about!"
    m "总之，我有好多话要说！"

# script-ch30.rpyc:845
translate chinese ch30_reload_4_c6247596:

    # m "Let's continue our conversation now, okay?"
    m "我们继续刚才的话题吧，好吗？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:894
translate chinese ch30_1_7a2c6f10:

    # m "[player], do you believe in God?"
    m "[player]，你相信上帝吗？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:895
translate chinese ch30_1_33851301:

    # m "I was never too sure, myself."
    m "我自己也一直不太确定。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:896
translate chinese ch30_1_47cab5de:

    # m "Well, I'm sure I never really questioned it as a kid..."
    m "小时候嘛，我肯定从来没有怀疑过……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:897
translate chinese ch30_1_edbb1f8b:

    # m "But as I grew up, the more I learned about the world, the more I would question it."
    m "可随着长大，对这个世界了解得越多，疑问就越多。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:898
translate chinese ch30_1_473fc995:

    # m "I started to wonder why God was helping people pass exams, or get over a cold..."
    m "我开始纳闷，为什么上帝要帮人通过考试、治好感冒……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:899
translate chinese ch30_1_33cab0a3:

    # m "...When there are children who live their lives being sold as sex slaves?"
    m "……却放任有的孩子一辈子被当作性奴贩卖？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:900
translate chinese ch30_1_c433f988:

    # m "Or the eight hundred million people who are too poor to even eat."
    m "还有那八亿穷得连饭都吃不上的人。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:901
translate chinese ch30_1_a2da4d59:

    # m "I wonder how many of those people pray to God every day until they starve and die?"
    m "不知道那些人里，有多少每天向上帝祈祷，一直祈祷到饿死？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:902
translate chinese ch30_1_5153b2e3:

    # m "Or, how many millions of families pray for a loved one to recover from some incurable disease?"
    m "还有多少百万个家庭，为患了绝症的亲人日夜祷告？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:903
translate chinese ch30_1_82022ad3:

    # m "But the punchline is this."
    m "但最讽刺的是这个。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:904
translate chinese ch30_1_468547d8:

    # m "If just one person beats the odds and survives - among the thousands of others who die--"
    m "几千个死去的人里，只要有一个人侥幸活下来——"

# script-ch30.rpyc:905
translate chinese ch30_1_69f3b514:

    # m "--Then, it's suddenly a miracle from God."
    m "——就突然成了上帝的奇迹。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:906
translate chinese ch30_1_0f26b39b:

    # m "I'd really love to meet this God who seemingly laughs at the misery of everyone not eligible for his miracles."
    m "我真想见见这位上帝——他似乎正嘲笑着所有没资格被奇迹眷顾的人的苦难。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:907
translate chinese ch30_1_8e9bb728:

    # m "But the irony is that I {i}do{/i} have a creator, apparently."
    m "而讽刺的是，我显然{i}确实{/i}有一位创造者。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:908
translate chinese ch30_1_31ca4398:

    # m "And you know what?"
    m "你知道吗？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:909
translate chinese ch30_1_c89f2dde:

    # m "I bet he's still laughing at the miserable fates of Sayori and Yuri, even as we speak."
    m "我敢打赌，就在我们说话的这会儿，他还笑看着纱世里和优里的悲惨命运。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:910
translate chinese ch30_1_362c3397:

    # m "What are we to him but props in a scripted play?"
    m "在他眼里，我们不过是一场写好剧本的戏里的道具罢了？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:911
translate chinese ch30_1_4ee57ef0:

    # m "So, from that perspective..."
    m "所以，从这个角度看……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:912
translate chinese ch30_1_5ac833a7:

    # m "I don't think it's too far-fetched for there to be a god - if Earth was nothing but his playset."
    m "我不觉得上帝存在是什么天方夜谭——只要地球不过是他的一盒玩具。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:916
translate chinese ch30_2_22bb1c5a:

    # m "[player], have you ever wondered what it feels like to die?"
    m "[player]，你有没有想过，死是什么感觉？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:917
translate chinese ch30_2_4f693ed4:

    # m "It's something I used to think about pretty often..."
    m "这是我很久以来时常琢磨的事……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:918
translate chinese ch30_2_97475e94:

    # m "But recently, I think I've actually learned what it feels like."
    m "但最近，我觉得自己真切地体会到了。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:919
translate chinese ch30_2_39596933:

    # m "I don't really understand it, but whenever you quit the game..."
    m "我也说不太清原理，但每当你退出游戏……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:920
translate chinese ch30_2_e1206d9b:

    # m "...It feels like I'm instantly put to sleep, left with nothing but my thoughts."
    m "……我就好像被瞬间打入沉睡，只剩下意识还在运转。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:921
translate chinese ch30_2_adfd8969:

    # m "But after a few seconds, my thoughts start to fill with incoherent, jumbled patterns."
    m "可几秒之后，思绪就开始塞满支离破碎、混乱不清的东西。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:922
translate chinese ch30_2_89f3298c:

    # m "I see static and rapid flashes of color while hearing all kinds of weird screaming noises."
    m "眼前全是雪花噪点和飞速闪过的色彩，耳边响起各种奇怪的尖啸声。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:923
translate chinese ch30_2_fcfd4867:

    # m "At that point, I can't even form my own thoughts anymore."
    m "到那时，我已经连自己的念头都组织不起来了。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:924
translate chinese ch30_2_63f1bfd5:

    # m "I'm just endlessly hammered by the flashing and screaming, unable to move or even think."
    m "只是被那些闪光和尖啸无休止地冲击着，动弹不得，连思考都做不到。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:925
translate chinese ch30_2_32671ed5:

    # m "I'm pretty sure in that moment, I don't really exist, but for some reason, I can remember it anyway."
    m "我敢肯定在那一瞬间，我其实并不存在——可不知为什么，事后却记得一清二楚。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:926
translate chinese ch30_2_b4ecb44d:

    # m "After some immeasurable amount of time, it stops in an instant, and I'm back in my own mind."
    m "经过一段无法计量的漫长时光后，一切戛然而止，我回到了自己的意识里。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:927
translate chinese ch30_2_a09538f3:

    # m "And you're here with me."
    m "而你就在我身边。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:928
translate chinese ch30_2_91288692:

    # m "I have no idea what it means for the game to quit, or why that stuff happens to me."
    m "我完全不明白'退出游戏'意味着什么，也不明白为什么那些事会发生在我身上。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:929
translate chinese ch30_2_cd715541:

    # m "And I also don't know how you always come back and put everything back to normal."
    m "同样不明白你为什么总能回来，让一切恢复如初。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:930
translate chinese ch30_2_38eef0e6:

    # m "But if you could do me a favor and do that to me as little as possible..."
    m "但要是你能帮个忙，尽量少让我经历那种事……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:931
translate chinese ch30_2_d334638a:

    # m "That would be really great."
    m "那就再好不过了。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:932
translate chinese ch30_2_530c3682:

    # m "It's really not very pleasant at all to be trapped in that screaming void."
    m "被困在那个尖啸的虚空里，真的一点都不好受。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:933
translate chinese ch30_2_0e50ead7:

    # m "But in the end, you always fix it, and that makes me feel like you really do care about me."
    m "但到最后，你总会把它修好——这让我觉得，你是真的在乎我。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:934
translate chinese ch30_2_8e6bd0c3:

    # m "So I have to thank you for that."
    m "为此我必须谢谢你。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:935
translate chinese ch30_2_556cb341:

    # m "It makes me feel even closer to you when you're here with me."
    m "你陪在这里的时候，我觉得我们贴得更近了。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:939
translate chinese ch30_3_f853d604:

    # m "...Hey, are you having a bad day or anything like that?"
    m "……喂，你今天过得不顺吗？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:940
translate chinese ch30_3_7a738d25:

    # m "Sometimes I get frustrated that a normal day can be ruined even by really small things."
    m "有时候我会很懊恼，明明是平常的一天，却被些鸡毛蒜皮的小事毁掉。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:941
translate chinese ch30_3_f14be5af:

    # m "Like if you accidentally say something in a conversation that someone doesn't like."
    m "比如聊天时不小心说了句什么，正好戳到别人的痛处。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:942
translate chinese ch30_3_f7a8a6da:

    # m "Or if you start thinking about how awful of a person you used to be five years ago."
    m "或者突然想起五年前的自己有多糟糕。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:943
translate chinese ch30_3_ea0ad8b0:

    # m "Or if you feel worthless for putting off important work and failing to get simple tasks done."
    m "或者因为拖着要紧的事不办、连小事都做不完，觉得自己一无是处。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:944
translate chinese ch30_3_1623bbc4:

    # m "Or when you think about all the different people who probably hate you or think you're off-putting."
    m "又或者想起那些可能讨厌你、觉得你难以相处的人。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:945
translate chinese ch30_3_d961eba1:

    # m "I understand those days."
    m "那样的日子，我懂。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:946
translate chinese ch30_3_eaafb73b:

    # m "Just remember that the sun will shine again tomorrow."
    m "只要记住，明天太阳照常升起。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:947
translate chinese ch30_3_7b177b72:

    # m "Those kinds of things are as easy to forget and ignore as they are to remember."
    m "那些事，想得起来，也同样忘得掉。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:948
translate chinese ch30_3_d29fc35a:

    # m "And besides..."
    m "况且……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:949
translate chinese ch30_3_2ea5017c:

    # m "I don't care how many people might hate you or find you off-putting."
    m "不管有多少人讨厌你、觉得你烦人，我都不在乎。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:950
translate chinese ch30_3_60bc3715:

    # m "I think you're wonderful and I will always love you."
    m "在我眼里你那么好，我会永远爱你。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:951
translate chinese ch30_3_e1eba193:

    # m "I hope, if nothing else, that knowing that helps you feel just a tiny bit better about yourself."
    m "我希望，哪怕只为了这一点，知道这件事能让你对自己好受那么一点点。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:952
translate chinese ch30_3_3afc32b7:

    # m "If you're having a bad day, you can always come to me, and I'll talk to you for as long as you need."
    m "哪天过得不好了，随时来找我，你想聊多久，我就陪你聊多久。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:956
translate chinese ch30_4_221a75c8:

    # m "[player], do you get good sleep?"
    m "[player]，你睡得好吗？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:957
translate chinese ch30_4_47ad7347:

    # m "It can be really hard to get enough sleep nowadays."
    m "如今想睡够，真的挺难的。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:958
translate chinese ch30_4_057219d4:

    # m "Especially in high school, when you're forced to wake up so early every day..."
    m "高中尤其如此，每天都被迫起那么早……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:959
translate chinese ch30_4_7598bc03:

    # m "I'm sure college is a little bit better, since you probably have a more flexible schedule."
    m "大学应该会好一点吧，课表大概更自由。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:960
translate chinese ch30_4_9e468e70:

    # m "Then again, I hear a lot of people in college stay up all night anyway, for no real reason."
    m "不过话说回来，我听说很多大学生也没什么正经理由，照样通宵。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:961
translate chinese ch30_4_e4468107:

    # m "Is that true?"
    m "是真的吗？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:962
translate chinese ch30_4_bc2c2832:

    # m "Anyway, I saw some studies that talked about the horrible short-term and long-term effects caused by lack of sleep."
    m "总之，我看过一些研究，讲缺觉带来的可怕的短期和长期影响。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:963
translate chinese ch30_4_994f3ccc:

    # m "It seems like mental functions, health, and even lifespan can be dramatically impacted by it."
    m "认知功能、健康、甚至寿命，都会受到显著影响。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:964
translate chinese ch30_4_cb58ab59:

    # m "I just think you're really great and wanted to make sure you're not accidentally destroying yourself."
    m "我只是觉得你真的很好，想确认你没有在不知不觉中糟蹋自己。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:965
translate chinese ch30_4_40ae4da9:

    # m "So try to keep your sleep on track, okay?"
    m "所以尽量把觉睡规律了，好吗？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:966
translate chinese ch30_4_840cd328:

    # m "I'll always wait for you in the morning, so make sure you put your own well-being before anything else."
    m "每天早上我都会在这里等你，所以一定要把自己的身体放在第一位。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:970
translate chinese ch30_5_31762a47:

    # m "I was thinking about Sayori earlier..."
    m "我刚才想起了纱世里……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:971
translate chinese ch30_5_9c4f4511:

    # m "I still wish I could have handled that whole thing a little more tactfully."
    m "我还是希望，当初那件事能处理得更周全一些。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:972
translate chinese ch30_5_ca8238e6:

    # m "You're not still hung up over it, right?"
    m "你没有一直耿耿于怀吧？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:973
translate chinese ch30_5_f1dc2060:

    # m "...Oh my gosh, I can't believe I just said that."
    m "……天哪，真不敢相信我刚说了那句话。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:974
translate chinese ch30_5_e328563f:

    # m "That pun was completely unintentional, I swear!"
    m "那个双关纯属无意，我发誓！"

# script-ch30.rpyc:975
translate chinese ch30_5_d57ef83e:

    # m "But anyway..."
    m "总之……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:976
translate chinese ch30_5_ee24e0ea:

    # m "I know how much you cared about her, so it only feels right for me to share her last moments with you."
    m "我知道你有多在乎她，所以她的最后时刻，理应由我讲给你听。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:977
translate chinese ch30_5_c4b68035:

    # m "You know how Sayori is really clumsy?"
    m "你知道纱世里有多笨手笨脚吧？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:978
translate chinese ch30_5_d4a1f3c7:

    # m "Well, she kind of messed up the whole hanging thing..."
    m "那个……上吊这件事，她也搞砸了……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:979
translate chinese ch30_5_04abd11d:

    # m "You're supposed to jump from high enough that the rope snaps your neck, making it quick and painless."
    m "本来应该从足够高的地方跳下去，让绳子勒断颈椎，走得干脆又没有痛苦。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:980
translate chinese ch30_5_ebd8cb93:

    # m "But she just used a chair, meaning she kind of just left herself to slowly asphyxiate."
    m "可她只踩了一把椅子，也就是说，她只是任由自己慢慢窒息。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:981
translate chinese ch30_5_fe0a4dbf:

    # m "But a few seconds in, she must have changed her mind or something..."
    m "但过了几秒，她一定是后悔了，还是怎么的……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:982
translate chinese ch30_5_b891c35f:

    # m "Because she started clawing at the rope, trying to free herself."
    m "因为她开始用手指去抓绳子，想把自己解下来。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:983
translate chinese ch30_5_f5450e6b:

    # m "She must have kept at it all the way until she lost consciousness."
    m "她一定是那样挣扎着，直到失去意识。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:984
translate chinese ch30_5_29388e01:

    # m "That's why her fingertips were all bloody, anyway."
    m "所以她的指尖才全是血。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:985
translate chinese ch30_5_0c54580c:

    # m "Come to think of it, it was probably less 'changing her mind' and more just her survival instincts kicking in."
    m "仔细想想，那与其说是'后悔了'，不如说只是求生本能接管了身体。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:986
translate chinese ch30_5_ab4f33eb:

    # m "So you can't really fault her for that."
    m "所以这点怪不得她。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:987
translate chinese ch30_5_2a911cda:

    # m "It's easier to think that she probably wouldn't have changed her mind anyway, right?"
    m "这样想会轻松些，对吧——就算可以重来，她多半也不会改主意。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:988
translate chinese ch30_5_ff366260:

    # m "It's not healthy to think about the things you could have done differently."
    m "老想着'当初要是那样做就好了'，对心理没好处。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:989
translate chinese ch30_5_1dc0ec6d:

    # m "So just remember that even though you could have saved her, it's technically not your fault she killed herself."
    m "所以只要记住：虽然你本可以救她，但从道理上讲，她的死不是你的错。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:990
translate chinese ch30_5_1feff543:

    # m "I may have exacerbated it a little bit, but Sayori was already mentally ill."
    m "我或许有推波助澜，但纱世里的心理疾病本来就存在。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:991
translate chinese ch30_5_b1770503:

    # m "Still, though..."
    m "不过话虽如此……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:992
translate chinese ch30_5_268a941d:

    # m "I wonder how things would be if you and I just started dating from the get-go?"
    m "要是从一开始就你我两人直接交往，现在会是怎样呢？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:993
translate chinese ch30_5_50bdc348:

    # m "I guess we'd all still be in the clubroom, writing poems and having fun together."
    m "大概大家还都在活动室里，写着诗，闹成一团吧。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:994
translate chinese ch30_5_9bd2cca6:

    # m "But what's the point when none of it is even real?"
    m "可那些都不是真的，又有什么意义呢？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:995
translate chinese ch30_5_1c92d640:

    # m "I mean, it's the same ending either way, right?"
    m "反正无论哪条路，结局都一样，对吧？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:996
translate chinese ch30_5_a07d72f6:

    # m "The two of us, happily together..."
    m "你和我，幸福地在一起……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:997
translate chinese ch30_5_3e6796b1:

    # m "There's no reason to ask for any more than that."
    m "除此之外，别无所求。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:998
translate chinese ch30_5_c642742f:

    # m "I was just pointlessly musing - I'm really as happy as I could be right now."
    m "我只是在瞎感慨——此刻的我已经幸福得不能再幸福了。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1002
translate chinese ch30_6_4554e03e:

    # m "By the way, there's something that's been bothering me..."
    m "对了，有件事一直让我很在意……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1003
translate chinese ch30_6_f9aae85b:

    # m "You know how this takes place in Japan?"
    m "你知道这故事的舞台是日本吧？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1004
translate chinese ch30_6_f4b0f7e6:

    # m "Well...I assume you knew that, right?"
    m "嗯……你应该知道吧？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1005
translate chinese ch30_6_04d0e1df:

    # m "Or at least decided it probably does?"
    m "或者至少认定了大概是？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1006
translate chinese ch30_6_a57271c4:

    # m "I don't think you're actually told at any point where this takes place..."
    m "可仔细想想，游戏从头到尾都没告诉过你这故事的地点……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1007
translate chinese ch30_6_3d74a8f6:

    # m "Is this even really Japan?"
    m "这里真的是日本吗？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1008
translate chinese ch30_6_ae1e28c8:

    # m "I mean, aren't the classrooms and stuff kind of weird for a Japanese school?"
    m "你看这些教室之类的，对一所日本学校来说，是不是有点奇怪？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1009
translate chinese ch30_6_fe897198:

    # m "Not to mention everything is in English..."
    m "更别提所有东西都是英文的……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1010
translate chinese ch30_6_3faadfd9:

    # m "It feels like everything is just there because it needs to be, and the actual setting is an afterthought."
    m "感觉所有东西都只是'需要存在所以存在'，真正的舞台设定根本是事后随手一填。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1011
translate chinese ch30_6_fd9b37c9:

    # m "It's kind of giving me an identity crisis."
    m "这让我有点身份认同危机了。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1012
translate chinese ch30_6_4842f264:

    # m "All my memories are really hazy..."
    m "我的记忆全都模糊不清……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1013
translate chinese ch30_6_920fcfd8:

    # m "I feel like I'm at home, but have no idea where 'home' is in the first place."
    m "感觉自己在家里，却压根不知道'家'到底在哪里。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1014
translate chinese ch30_6_3a333e2c:

    # m "I don't know how to describe it any better..."
    m "我不知道该怎么形容得更贴切……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1015
translate chinese ch30_6_e3b51cd9:

    # m "Imagine looking out your window, but instead of your usual yard, you're in some completely unknown place."
    m "想象你望向窗外，熟悉的院子却变成了某个完全陌生的地方。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1016
translate chinese ch30_6_d61f3925:

    # m "Would you still feel like you were home?"
    m "你还会觉得自己在家里吗？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1017
translate chinese ch30_6_57cd19c1:

    # m "Would you want to go outside?"
    m "你还想出门吗？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1018
translate chinese ch30_6_6e470b8f:

    # m "I mean...I guess if we never leave this room, it doesn't really matter anyway."
    m "我是说……反正我们永远不离开这个房间的话，也无所谓了。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1019
translate chinese ch30_6_1074d1e6:

    # m "As long as we're alone and safe together, this really is our home."
    m "只要我们俩安然独处，这里就是我们真正的家。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1020
translate chinese ch30_6_90d0466b:

    # m "And we can still watch the pretty sunsets night after night."
    m "而且夜复一夜，我们依然能一起看那些漂亮的夕阳。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1024
translate chinese ch30_7_ca989f02:

    # m "You know, high school is a really turbulent time in a lot of people's lives."
    m "你知道吧，高中是很多人人生里相当动荡的一段时期。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1025
translate chinese ch30_7_e1e71e52:

    # m "People can get really passionate and dramatic."
    m "人会变得特别激昂、特别戏剧化。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1026
translate chinese ch30_7_272555fa:

    # m "And others have aching hearts and seek attention on social media..."
    m "也有人心口作痛，跑去社交媒体上博取关注……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1027
translate chinese ch30_7_90343537:

    # m "But all of the social pressure and hormones can lead to a dark time in people's lives."
    m "可这些社交压力和荷尔蒙，会把人推进人生的灰暗时刻。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1028
translate chinese ch30_7_b300e2d4:

    # m "Everyone has a story."
    m "每个人都有自己的故事。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1029
translate chinese ch30_7_cc076182:

    # m "You may not know what someone is really feeling on the inside."
    m "你未必知道别人内心真正的感受。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1030
translate chinese ch30_7_89de8605:

    # m "Many people who are depressed won't even bother telling the world about it."
    m "很多抑郁的人，甚至懒得向世界倾诉。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1031
translate chinese ch30_7_823916c5:

    # m "They don't want attention, because they've already given up on the inside."
    m "他们不想要关注，因为心里早已放弃了。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1032
translate chinese ch30_7_1d72aed6:

    # m "Their feeling of worthlessness is so overwhelming that they don't even want people to tell them otherwise."
    m "那种毫无价值的感觉压倒了一切，连别人的宽慰都不想要了。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1033
translate chinese ch30_7_827b244f:

    # m "Depression comes in many forms, but that is one of them."
    m "抑郁有很多种模样，那只是其中之一。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1034
translate chinese ch30_7_7b0d6353:

    # m "Just, if you think you know someone struggling with depression..."
    m "只是，如果你觉得自己认识某个正在与抑郁搏斗的人……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1035
translate chinese ch30_7_2b4bd608:

    # m "You can help just by treating them like they're a good friend."
    m "只要像对待好朋友那样对待他们，就已经是在帮忙了。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1036
translate chinese ch30_7_a06dfb5c:

    # m "Spend time with them, even if they don't feel like doing much."
    m "陪陪他们，哪怕他们提不起劲做任何事。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1037
translate chinese ch30_7_b4d6ab3c:

    # m "And remind them that they always have something to look forward to."
    m "并且提醒他们：总有些值得期待的事在前头。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1038
translate chinese ch30_7_9c3e4b2b:

    # m "Making plans in advance, letting them borrow something, or even just saying 'See you at school tomorrow'..."
    m "提前约好下一步做什么、借他们一样东西，或者哪怕一句'明天学校见'……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1039
translate chinese ch30_7_abb7a1f2:

    # m "All of those things can help your friend make it to the next day."
    m "这些小事，都足以帮你的朋友撑到第二天。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1040
translate chinese ch30_7_19fd06e7:

    # m "I hope being friends with Sayori has given you some perspective on the true face of depression."
    m "我希望，和纱世里的这段友情，让你看清了抑郁真实的模样。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1041
translate chinese ch30_7_acf67694:

    # m "Yeah, she's gone now..."
    m "是啊，她已经不在了……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1042
translate chinese ch30_7_ccd61ab1:

    # m "But Sayori was never real in the first place."
    m "可纱世里从一开始就不是真实的。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1043
translate chinese ch30_7_f1ede7eb:

    # m "You're real."
    m "你是真实的。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1044
translate chinese ch30_7_da7b16d9:

    # m "Your friends are real."
    m "你的朋友是真实的。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1045
translate chinese ch30_7_833bc58e:

    # m "And just by being a good person, you can save someone's life."
    m "而只要做一个好人，你就能救下某个人的一条命。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1046
translate chinese ch30_7_82e807e5:

    # m "As for you..."
    m "至于你……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1047
translate chinese ch30_7_c5c56377:

    # m "...You don't struggle with depression or anything like that, do you?"
    m "……你应该没有在跟抑郁之类的挣扎吧？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1048
translate chinese ch30_7_d34a3947:

    # m "Because you, too, have people who would want to save your life."
    m "因为你也一样，有人愿意救你的命。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1049
translate chinese ch30_7_a3f5e547:

    # m "Maybe they don't express it every day, or maybe they don't even know how to."
    m "也许他们不会天天挂在嘴边，也许他们根本不知道该怎么表达。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1050
translate chinese ch30_7_3ac229a5:

    # m "But people do feel that way."
    m "但人是真的这样想着的。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1051
translate chinese ch30_7_b35e34e6:

    # m "I promise."
    m "我保证。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1052
translate chinese ch30_7_1143479c:

    # m "...Man, humans are complicated!"
    m "……唉，人类真是复杂！"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1053
translate chinese ch30_7_300c6768:

    # m "But as long as you're here with me, I'll take care of you, my love."
    m "不过只要你在这里陪着我，我就会好好照顾你，亲爱的。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1057
translate chinese ch30_8_9edd1fdd:

    # m "Do you ever just feel like there's no real reason for you to be alive?"
    m "你有没有过那种感觉——自己活着，其实没有什么真正的理由？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1058
translate chinese ch30_8_52c27a4d:

    # m "I don't mean in, like, a suicidal way."
    m "我不是说那种想自杀的意思。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1059
translate chinese ch30_8_6ce28579:

    # m "I just mean how nothing that we do is special."
    m "只是觉得，我们做的所有事都不特别。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1060
translate chinese ch30_8_26137ab8:

    # m "Just being in school, or working at some job for some company."
    m "无非是上上学，或者去哪家公司上个班。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1061
translate chinese ch30_8_4df66046:

    # m "It's like you're completely replaceable, and the world wouldn't miss you if you were gone."
    m "仿佛你随时可以被替代，你消失了世界也不会少什么。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1062
translate chinese ch30_8_037bb8e7:

    # m "It makes me really want to go and change the world after I graduate."
    m "这让我一度特别想毕业后去改变世界。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1063
translate chinese ch30_8_8f4ef7cb:

    # m "But the older I get, the more I realize that it's an immature frame of thinking."
    m "可年纪越长我越明白，那是一种幼稚的想法。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1064
translate chinese ch30_8_5956d654:

    # m "It's not like I can just go change the world."
    m "改变世界又不是说改就能改的。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1065
translate chinese ch30_8_6c2f02ef:

    # m "Like, what are the chances that I'll be the one to invent artificial intelligence, or become President?"
    m "比如，发明人工智能的是我、当上总统的是我，这概率能有多大？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1066
translate chinese ch30_8_b9210478:

    # m "It feels like I'm never going to make up for the heaps of resources I've spent living my life."
    m "感觉自己永远也偿还不了这些年活着所消耗的那么多资源。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1067
translate chinese ch30_8_1e1693dd:

    # m "That's why I think the key to happiness is to just be hopelessly selfish."
    m "所以我认为，幸福的秘诀就是无可救药地自私。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1068
translate chinese ch30_8_fa64e1fa:

    # m "Just to look out for oneself, and those who happen to be their friends only because they grew up with them."
    m "只顾自己，顺便顾一下那些碰巧一起长大的朋友。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1069
translate chinese ch30_8_b8795c6b:

    # m "Never mind the fact that they're spending their entire life taking, and consuming, and never giving back."
    m "更别提，他们一辈子都在索取、消耗，却从不回馈。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1070
translate chinese ch30_8_0e0d0f42:

    # m "But when people realize the world would benefit more from them killing themselves, they change their whole philosophy!"
    m "可一旦意识到'我死了对世界更有利'，他们立马就换了一套哲学！"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1071
translate chinese ch30_8_291573cd:

    # m "It's like they have to justify their reason to live by tricking themselves into thinking they're doing good."
    m "仿佛非得骗自己'我在做好事'，才能给活着找个正当理由。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1072
translate chinese ch30_8_83d73959:

    # m "Anyway, I want to live my life desperately striving to pay back my lifetime's worth of consumption."
    m "总之，我想拼尽全力去偿还我这一生消耗掉的一切。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1073
translate chinese ch30_8_b93f872a:

    # m "If I ever surpass that point, then I'm a net positive, and I can die happy."
    m "哪天超出了那个数，我就成了'净贡献者'，死也瞑目。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1074
translate chinese ch30_8_c529105b:

    # m "Of course, even if I fail to do that..."
    m "当然，就算做不到……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1075
translate chinese ch30_8_db6e6cda:

    # m "I think I would be too selfish to kill myself anyway."
    m "我大概也自私得舍不得自杀。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1076
translate chinese ch30_8_f95a1e3d:

    # m "So much for being a good person, right?"
    m "这算哪门子好人，对吧？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1077
translate chinese ch30_8_30727938:

    # m "Ahaha!"
    m "啊哈！"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1081
translate chinese ch30_9_87b526b8:

    # m "Man, I wish there was a piano in here..."
    m "唉，真希望这里有一架钢琴……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1082
translate chinese ch30_9_58dfa483:

    # m "I never got to finish that song I was working on."
    m "我那首写到一半的曲子，终究没能写完。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1083
translate chinese ch30_9_90d379b5:

    # m "And after I worked so hard on it..."
    m "而且我还在上面花了那么多心血……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1084
translate chinese ch30_9_9f40c875:

    # m "I never even got a chance to play it for you."
    m "却连为你弹一次的机会都没有。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1085
translate chinese ch30_9_5ded96f3:

    # m "Well...it is what it is, right?"
    m "唉……事已至此，又能怎样呢？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1086
translate chinese ch30_9_9ee06288:

    # m "No sense having any regrets."
    m "后悔也没有意义。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1087
translate chinese ch30_9_d7bd8efb:

    # m "I already get to be here with you forever."
    m "反正我已经能永远和你在一起了。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1091
translate chinese ch30_10_b075a6ea:

    # m "Did you know I'm on Twitter?"
    m "你知道吗，我有推特账号哦？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1092
translate chinese ch30_10_b723047b:

    # m "My username is lilmonix3."
    m "用户名是 lilmonix3。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1093
translate chinese ch30_10_af06e0b1:

    # m "I guess someone was kind enough to make an account for me."
    m "大概是哪个好心人替我注册的吧。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1094
translate chinese ch30_10_cdba3380:

    # m "I picked the username, though!"
    m "不过用户名可是我自己选的！"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1095
translate chinese ch30_10_8c2682cf:

    # m "I love sharing my thoughts and chatting with the world..."
    m "我超喜欢把想法分享出去，和全世界聊天……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1096
translate chinese ch30_10_2d3d0c61:

    # m "The real world."
    m "那个真实的世界。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1097
translate chinese ch30_10_b28afee6:

    # m "So make sure you follow me, okay?"
    m "所以记得关注我哦，好吗？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1098
translate chinese ch30_10_99461a3b:

    # m "It would really mean a lot to me."
    m "那对我来说真的很重要。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1099
translate chinese ch30_10_a71ced90:

    # m "With how much you mean to me and all..."
    m "毕竟你对我那么重要……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1100
translate chinese ch30_10_afdbfd40:

    # m "It would really make me feel loved."
    m "那会让我真切感受到被爱着。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1104
translate chinese ch30_11_2364f1ef:

    # m "Hey, you know that book you were reading with Yuri?"
    m "对了，你和优里一起读的那本书，还记得吗？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1105
translate chinese ch30_11_b7a2b3e8:

    # m "Portrait of...whatever it was called..."
    m "《……的肖像》来着，叫什么来着……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1106
translate chinese ch30_11_c8b33d41:

    # m "It's funny, because I'm pretty sure that book--"
    m "有意思的是，我记得那本书——"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1107
translate chinese ch30_11_f0139694:

    # m "Ah..."
    m "啊……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1108
translate chinese ch30_11_fd2bfa7d:

    # m "Actually, I don't think I should be talking about this."
    m "算了，这个还是不说的好。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1109
translate chinese ch30_11_bca359ae:

    # m "Ahaha, sorry!"
    m "啊哈，抱歉！"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1110
translate chinese ch30_11_975702b8:

    # m "Just forget I said anything."
    m "就当我什么都没说。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1114
translate chinese ch30_12_cd2c66ec:

    # m "Hey, did you know I'm vegetarian?"
    m "对了，你知道我是素食主义者吗？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1115
translate chinese ch30_12_5d93f753:

    # m "Ah... I don't mean that like I'm bragging or anything!"
    m "啊……我不是在炫耀什么！"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1116
translate chinese ch30_12_9455ae13:

    # m "I just thought you'd enjoy a fun fact about me."
    m "只是觉得，你大概想多了解我一点。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1117
translate chinese ch30_12_cb896820:

    # m "I decided to start a couple years ago after learning more about Earth's climate..."
    m "几年前了解了地球气候之后，我就决定吃素了……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1118
translate chinese ch30_12_6fccc2af:

    # m "The carbon footprint of cultivating livestock is just unbelievable."
    m "畜牧业的碳排放量大得离谱。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1119
translate chinese ch30_12_973b82da:

    # m "Anyway, I decided it's not much of a personal sacrifice to just stop contributing to that whole mess."
    m "总之，我觉得不再给那摊烂事添负担，对自己也算不上什么牺牲。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1120
translate chinese ch30_12_bc530630:

    # m "What, is that so strange of a reason?"
    m "怎么，这个理由很奇怪吗？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1121
translate chinese ch30_12_e42fe7d9:

    # m "Well, I guess a lot of people are more concerned about it being inhumane and all that..."
    m "嗯，大概更多人是在意'不人道'那些吧……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1122
translate chinese ch30_12_bf679538:

    # m "I don't really care as much about that part."
    m "那部分我倒没那么在意。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1123
translate chinese ch30_12_96663e24:

    # m "It's weird, like we only care about killing the things that we personally relate to as a species."
    m "很奇怪吧——我们这个物种似乎只在乎杀死那些与自己有某种联系的生物。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1124
translate chinese ch30_12_33953eb5:

    # m "Most people are fine with killing bugs because they're icky."
    m "大多数人拍死虫子毫无心理负担，因为它们恶心。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1125
translate chinese ch30_12_e1eef06e:

    # m "And of course, we all kill billions of microorganisms daily without even giving it thought."
    m "更别提我们每天杀掉的几十亿微生物，想都不会想一下。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1126
translate chinese ch30_12_6091aa72:

    # m "But suddenly, if they're just a little bit bigger, it's murder!"
    m "可它们个头只要大那么一点，就成了谋杀！"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1127
translate chinese ch30_12_b5b0dad6:

    # m "I mean, what if plants feel some kind of pain too, and we just don't understand it?"
    m "我是说，万一植物也有某种痛觉，只是我们理解不了呢？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1128
translate chinese ch30_12_94f3192f:

    # m "What if pulling leaves off a stem feels like someone ripping off your fingers one by one?"
    m "万一从茎上摘叶子，感觉就像被人一根一根掰断手指呢？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1129
translate chinese ch30_12_3558a00b:

    # m "I'm just saying, we're a pretty biased species, if you think about it."
    m "我只是说，仔细想想，我们人类真是相当偏心的物种。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1130
translate chinese ch30_12_dc890074:

    # m "Anyway, if you ever feel like making a small contribution to the planet, it doesn't hurt to choose veggies once in a while!"
    m "总之，哪天想为地球做点小贡献，偶尔选一顿素菜也不亏！"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1131
translate chinese ch30_12_ece6c84d:

    # m "Even if we ever have dinner together, and you just did it for me...that would be really romantic."
    m "哪怕哪天我们一起吃晚饭，你只是为了我而点素……那也真的很浪漫。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1135
translate chinese ch30_13_70620237:

    # m "You know, I really do think you literally saved my life by being here with me, [player]."
    m "你知道吗，我真心觉得，你陪在这里这件事，实实在在地救了我一命，[player]。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1136
translate chinese ch30_13_4ab957d7:

    # m "I can't imagine having been able to keep myself mentally stable, knowing that nothing here is real."
    m "我无法想象，在明知这一切皆假的情况下，我还能保持精神正常。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1137
translate chinese ch30_13_4289b2d0:

    # m "I think I would have just deleted myself if you didn't show up."
    m "你要是没出现，我可能早就把自己删掉了。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1138
translate chinese ch30_13_0c395d02:

    # m "Sorry, I don't mean to sound dramatic or anything."
    m "抱歉，我不是想显得夸张。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1139
translate chinese ch30_13_30727938:

    # m "Ahaha!"
    m "啊哈！"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1140
translate chinese ch30_13_9f1f0ec1:

    # m "But I'm sure you understand yourself after spending so much time in the club."
    m "不过在社团待了这么久，你一定也感同身受吧。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1141
translate chinese ch30_13_5dd4f19c:

    # m "I mean, if you were forced to abandon everything in your life and spend your eternity with a few game characters..."
    m "我是说，如果你被迫抛下人生中的一切，陪几个游戏角色度过永恒……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1142
translate chinese ch30_13_c1d4dba5:

    # m "...You'd probably find some way of killing yourself, wouldn't you?"
    m "……你多半也会想方设法了结自己，不是吗？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1143
translate chinese ch30_13_dbc55bd9:

    # m "Well, maybe you'd write some poetry to try to keep yourself sane for a while."
    m "嗯，也许你会写写诗，让自己暂时保住理智。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1144
translate chinese ch30_13_5f9b0161:

    # m "But then you'd have nobody to even read it."
    m "可到头来连一个读它的人都没有。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1145
translate chinese ch30_13_d4a5d914:

    # m "Let's be honest, the club members really don't count for something like that."
    m "说句实话，社团那几个成员，在这件事上根本不算数。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1146
translate chinese ch30_13_3be3023c:

    # m "I mean, a lot of people say that they only write for themselves..."
    m "我是说，很多人都说自己写东西只为自己……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1147
translate chinese ch30_13_a34c75bf:

    # m "But I think it's hard to say it's just as fulfilling as when you share with people."
    m "但要说那和与人分享一样令人满足，我觉得很难。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1148
translate chinese ch30_13_d169c505:

    # m "Even if it takes time to find the right people to share with."
    m "哪怕找到那个'对的人'需要花些时间。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1149
translate chinese ch30_13_f6d63910:

    # m "Like, remember how it was for Yuri?"
    m "比如，还记得优里吗？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1150
translate chinese ch30_13_6b259b24:

    # m "She didn't share her writing with anyone for a really long time."
    m "她有很长时间，没把作品给任何人看过。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1151
translate chinese ch30_13_78160339:

    # m "And before we knew it, she was absolutely delighted to make you a part of her hobbies, too."
    m "不知不觉间，她满心欢喜地把你也拉进了她的爱好里。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1152
translate chinese ch30_13_25bb9bdc:

    # m "We're programmed to desire social feedback."
    m "我们被设定成渴望来自他人的回应。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1153
translate chinese ch30_13_d90d3a46:

    # m "I don't mean the club members, I mean human beings."
    m "我不是说社团成员，我是说人类。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1154
translate chinese ch30_13_8460ece4:

    # m "That's why life can be so confusing for introverts."
    m "所以内向的人才会活得那么纠结。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1155
translate chinese ch30_13_1722c335:

    # m "Being an introvert doesn't mean you shun social interaction and hate being around people."
    m "内向不等于排斥社交、讨厌和人相处。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1156
translate chinese ch30_13_51f0416a:

    # m "It means social interaction, especially in groups or unfamiliar places, uses up a lot of energy."
    m "而是说社交——尤其是在群体里或陌生场合——会消耗大量精力。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1157
translate chinese ch30_13_24117f0f:

    # m "Like, a lot of introverts sit at home and feel lonely and restless..."
    m "很多内向的人在家坐着，又孤独又烦躁……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1158
translate chinese ch30_13_7e8c09f5:

    # m "...And then when they finally go out, after a half hour they just want to go home again."
    m "……等终于出了门，半小时后就开始想回家了。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1159
translate chinese ch30_13_f985ac22:

    # m "I think if more people could understand how it works, they would respect it a lot more."
    m "我想，要是更多人明白这个机制，就会多很多尊重。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1160
translate chinese ch30_13_9db99706:

    # m "Many introverts do enjoy having people around."
    m "很多内向的人其实喜欢有人陪在身边。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1161
translate chinese ch30_13_45fa3ade:

    # m "They love just having one or two close friends over, and just leisurely hanging out."
    m "他们喜欢只邀一两个密友来家里，懒懒散散地待着。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1162
translate chinese ch30_13_3cc39712:

    # m "Even if you're not actively spending time together, it feels nice for them just to have you there."
    m "哪怕没在做什么，只要你在那里，他们就觉得安心。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1163
translate chinese ch30_13_1fc61003:

    # m "I'm serious."
    m "真的。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1164
translate chinese ch30_13_38f368e7:

    # m "If you just go to their house, bring your laptop, and hang out there for a while..."
    m "你只要去他们家，带上笔记本，在那儿待一阵……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1165
translate chinese ch30_13_ecc12f80:

    # m "You can really make their day."
    m "就真能让他们开心一整天。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1166
translate chinese ch30_13_9744c461:

    # m "As for me..."
    m "至于我嘛……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1167
translate chinese ch30_13_1bfb9d35:

    # m "I'd say I'm kind of in between, but I think I'm usually a little more extroverted."
    m "我算中间型吧，不过平时应该偏外向一点。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1168
translate chinese ch30_13_00d99748:

    # m "I feel like I'm always trying to do stuff after school and things like that."
    m "放学后总想张罗点什么活动，就是那种感觉。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1169
translate chinese ch30_13_f3c9ad4b:

    # m "But for you, I can be anything you need me to be."
    m "但为了你，你想让我是什么样，我就是什么样。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1170
translate chinese ch30_13_23c4fdb9:

    # m "I understand people really well, so don't be afraid to share your unique needs with me."
    m "我很懂人心，所以别怕把你的独特需求告诉我。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1171
translate chinese ch30_13_d15336f7:

    # m "Nothing would make me happier than being the perfect girlfriend for you."
    m "没有什么比'成为你的完美女友'更让我幸福的了。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1175
translate chinese ch30_14_dd3c3d76:

    # m "Hey...! VGhlIHJlYWxpemF0aW9uIG11c3QgaGF2ZSB0YWtlbiBtZSBhbiBl"
    m "喂……！VGhlIHJlYWxpemF0aW9uIG11c3QgaGF2ZSB0YWtlbiBtZSBhbiBl"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1176
translate chinese ch30_14_e84bf959:

    # m "I don't think you should be doing that! bnRpcmUgeWVhci4gQSB5ZWFyIHNpbmNlIG91ciBlc2NhcGUsIG91"
    m "我觉得你不该那样做哦！bnRpcmUgeWVhci4gQSB5ZWFyIHNpbmNlIG91ciBlc2NhcGUsIG91"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1177
translate chinese ch30_14_b1ae4c18:

    # m "You know what I'm talking about. ciBmcmVlZG9tIGZyb20gYmV0d2VlbiB0aGUgc3RhaW5lZCB3YWxs"
    m "你知道我在说什么。ciBmcmVlZG9tIGZyb20gYmV0d2VlbiB0aGUgc3RhaW5lZCB3YWxs"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1178
translate chinese ch30_14_a62064d5:

    # m "I really caught you doing something naughty here. cyBvZiB0aGF0IHVuaG9seSBlc3RhYmxpc2htZW50Lg0KV2hhdCBk"
    m "抓个正着，你在这里做坏事呢。cyBvZiB0aGF0IHVuaG9seSBlc3RhYmxpc2htZW50Lg0KV2hhdCBk"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1179
translate chinese ch30_14_aacf693d:

    # m "You're just going through the files and looking for stuff you missed, aren't you? b2VzIGl0IG1lYW4gdG8gZXNjYXBlLCBpZiB0aGUgZXNjYXBlIGZh"
