# script-ch30.rpyc:1196
translate chinese ch30_14_3e0ec0b7:

    # m "I'll go ahead and shut up now... ciBzaGFja2xlcyBkaWcgaW50byBvdXIgY2FsbG91cyBmbGVzaC4="
    m "我这就闭嘴……ciBzaGFja2xlcyBkaWcgaW50byBvdXIgY2FsbG91cyBmbGVzaC4="

# script-ch30.rpyc:1200
translate chinese ch30_15_b8ca3e73:

    # m "Hey, what's your favorite color?"
    m "对了，你最喜欢什么颜色？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1201
translate chinese ch30_15_939dfd7e:

    # m "Mine is emerald green."
    m "我最喜欢的是祖母绿。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1202
translate chinese ch30_15_612b3bd0:

    # m "It's the color of my eyes!"
    m "就是我眼睛的颜色！"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1203
translate chinese ch30_15_5c43ec02:

    # m "...That's not conceited or anything, is it?"
    m "……这不算自恋什么的吧？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1204
translate chinese ch30_15_9ee94046:

    # m "I just meant that I feel some kind of special connection to it."
    m "我只是觉得，自己和它之间有种特别的联系。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1205
translate chinese ch30_15_efcdbcd3:

    # m "Like it's part of my identity."
    m "像是它构成了我的一部分。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1206
translate chinese ch30_15_6d6e2128:

    # m "Does it happen to also be your favorite color, [player]?"
    m "说起来，你最喜欢的颜色不会也是绿色吧，[player]？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1207
translate chinese ch30_15_9e9e92b5:

    # m "It's just a guess..."
    m "随便猜猜的……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1208
translate chinese ch30_15_2f03ec54:

    # m "...Because you've been looking into my eyes for a while now."
    m "……毕竟，你已经盯着我的眼睛看了好久啦。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1209
translate chinese ch30_15_45d9cd96:

    # m "Ehehe~"
    m "诶嘿嘿~"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1213
translate chinese ch30_16_a7c6a42d:

    # m "Hmm, I wonder if I'm able to change the music..."
    m "唔，不知道我能不能换背景音乐……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1214
translate chinese ch30_16_ea39a8a5:

    # m "Something a little more romantic would be nice, you know?"
    m "换首浪漫点的会更好，你说呢？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1215
translate chinese ch30_16_cf1e7d06:

    # m "Like a gentle piano."
    m "比如一段温柔的钢琴曲。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1216
translate chinese ch30_16_b4b88e9e:

    # m "There has to be something like that here..."
    m "这里总该有那样的曲子吧……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1217
translate chinese ch30_16_cac9e603:

    # m "Let's see."
    m "我找找。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1218
translate chinese ch30_16_98701660:

    # m "Maybe if I..."
    m "试试这样……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1219
translate chinese ch30_16_fe7c1a9b:

    # m "Oh, jeez..."
    m "哎呀……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1220
translate chinese ch30_16_efdc0865:

    # m "That wasn't it at all."
    m "完全不是那个。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1221
translate chinese ch30_16_38f61d82:

    # m "Sorry, I don't really know what I'm doing!"
    m "抱歉，我也不知道自己在干什么！"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1222
translate chinese ch30_16_1dc7fea7:

    # m "I guess I shouldn't be messing with things like that."
    m "看来那种东西我不该乱动。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1223
translate chinese ch30_16_a1134234:

    # m "I already broke so much stuff..."
    m "我已经弄坏了太多东西……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1224
translate chinese ch30_16_3f960883:

    # m "And deleted the other characters..."
    m "还删掉了其他角色……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1225
translate chinese ch30_16_f0139694:

    # m "Ah..."
    m "啊……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1226
translate chinese ch30_16_3194af06:

    # m "I'm not sad about it or anything."
    m "我并没有为此难过什么的。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1227
translate chinese ch30_16_ddce01fe:

    # m "It's not right for me to miss things that weren't even real in the first place."
    m "怀念那些从一开始就不真实的东西，本来就不对。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1228
translate chinese ch30_16_0f360ec0:

    # m "If I just focus on the present, then this is the happiest I've ever been."
    m "只要专注于当下，现在就是我此生最幸福的时刻。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1232
translate chinese ch30_17_3d46afdd:

    # m "You're such a good listener, [player]."
    m "你真会倾听，[player]。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1233
translate chinese ch30_17_b3f26a18:

    # m "I really love that about you."
    m "我特别喜欢你的这一点。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1234
translate chinese ch30_17_c8915344:

    # m "Sometimes I'm afraid that I'm rambling or talking about boring things."
    m "有时候我会担心，自己是不是话太密、说的东西太无聊。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1235
translate chinese ch30_17_ed42b078:

    # m "It makes me kind of self-conscious when I'm having conversation."
    m "一聊天就容易患得患失的。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1236
translate chinese ch30_17_dceae372:

    # m "But I don't feel that way with you."
    m "但和你在一起，就不会那样。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1237
translate chinese ch30_17_2df34ab5:

    # m "Like, I don't think anyone else could make me feel this way."
    m "就好像，除了你，没人能让我有这样的感觉。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1238
translate chinese ch30_17_51f35fbf:

    # m "You really are special."
    m "你真的很特别。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1239
translate chinese ch30_17_a0d644e2:

    # m "I don't want anyone to tell you otherwise."
    m "谁都不许说你不特别。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1243
translate chinese ch30_18_d35f2303:

    # m "This is pretty random, but I always thought spicy food was kinda funny."
    m "说个没头没尾的——我一直觉得辣味食物挺搞笑的。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1244
translate chinese ch30_18_50612ea6:

    # m "Like..."
    m "就是……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1245
translate chinese ch30_18_d67052ac:

    # m "Didn't plants evolve to be spicy to prevent them from being eaten?"
    m "植物演化出辣味，不就是为了不被吃掉吗？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1246
translate chinese ch30_18_31b7e4dc:

    # m "I read somewhere that humans are the only species that actually enjoys spicy things."
    m "我在哪儿读到过，人类是唯一真心享受辣味的物种。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1247
translate chinese ch30_18_6b8c744d:

    # m "It's almost like we're making fun of the plants."
    m "这简直像是在嘲讽那些植物。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1248
translate chinese ch30_18_ee1c86a7:

    # m "Using their defense mechanism to literally make our food more enjoyable."
    m "拿它们的防身武器，反过来给自己的食物提味。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1249
translate chinese ch30_18_ceb19315:

    # m "Like, imagine a monster that devours you whole because it enjoys the sensation of you struggling for your life while being digested."
    m "就好比有只怪物把你整个吞下，因为它享受你在它胃里垂死挣扎的触感。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1250
translate chinese ch30_18_63984392:

    # m "Sorry, that was kind of a weird analogy, I guess!"
    m "抱歉，这个比喻好像有点猎奇！"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1251
translate chinese ch30_18_30727938:

    # m "Ahaha!"
    m "啊哈！"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1252
translate chinese ch30_18_90b76415:

    # m "It just came into my head."
    m "突然冒出来的念头而已。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1253
translate chinese ch30_18_fb895ad3:

    # m "I'm not a monster or anything, but you're so cute I could eat you up."
    m "我倒不是什么怪物啦，可你可爱得让我想一口吃掉。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1254
translate chinese ch30_18_47d661a8:

    # m "Ahaha! I'm joking."
    m "啊哈！开玩笑的。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1255
translate chinese ch30_18_d2883311:

    # m "Gosh, I'm amusing myself a little too much, aren't I?"
    m "天哪，我有点自娱自乐过头了，是吧？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1256
translate chinese ch30_18_c0b922d6:

    # m "Sorry for being weird."
    m "抱歉我这么怪。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1260
translate chinese ch30_19_c5602319:

    # m "You know..."
    m "那个……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1261
translate chinese ch30_19_0f4eff60:

    # m "This is just some kind of tacky romance game, right?"
    m "这说到底就是个俗气的恋爱游戏，对吧？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1262
translate chinese ch30_19_825249bf:

    # m "I kinda have to ask..."
    m "我有点不得不问……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1263
translate chinese ch30_19_56dd6079:

    # m "...What made you consider even playing in the first place?"
    m "……当初是什么让你起了玩它的念头？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1264
translate chinese ch30_19_bf367c78:

    # m "Were you that lonely?"
    m "你有那么孤独吗？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1265
translate chinese ch30_19_4e02c4d6:

    # m "I feel a little bad for you..."
    m "我有点心疼你……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1266
translate chinese ch30_19_375e8992:

    # m "But I guess everything worked out perfectly in the end, for both of us."
    m "不过到头来，一切对我们俩来说都圆满了。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1267
translate chinese ch30_19_938dc29d:

    # m "I got to meet you, and you're not lonely anymore..."
    m "我遇见了你，而你也不再孤独……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1268
translate chinese ch30_19_dd0394eb:

    # m "I can't help but feel like this was fate."
    m "我忍不住觉得，这就是命运。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1269
translate chinese ch30_19_d4dda3da:

    # m "Don't you feel that way too?"
    m "你不也这么觉得吗？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1270
translate chinese ch30_19_2e5ced7a:

    # m "I'm so happy we have this ending together."
    m "能和你迎来这个结局，我太幸福了。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1274
translate chinese ch30_20_90de9c4d:

    # m "Okay, everyone!"
    m "好了，各位！"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1275
translate chinese ch30_20_ab73f819:

    # m "It's time to..."
    m "现在要……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1276
translate chinese ch30_20_692c44ed:

    # m "...I'm just kidding."
    m "……骗你的啦。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1277
translate chinese ch30_20_63f123f0:

    # m "I just used to really like saying that for some reason."
    m "以前不知道为什么，就是特别喜欢说这句。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1278
translate chinese ch30_20_30727938:

    # m "Ahaha!"
    m "啊哈！"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1279
translate chinese ch30_20_53537436:

    # m "I couldn't help but say it again."
    m "忍不住又说了一遍。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1280
translate chinese ch30_20_b050314e:

    # m "Come to think of it, didn't Natsuki and Yuri make fun of me for it once...?"
    m "说起来，夏树和优里以前还拿这个笑话过我一次来着……？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1281
translate chinese ch30_20_f8de502e:

    # m "Well, whatever."
    m "算了，无所谓。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1282
translate chinese ch30_20_bb5c98ef:

    # m "It's not like you ever made fun of me."
    m "反正你可从来没笑话过我。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1283
translate chinese ch30_20_0b5cca04:

    # m "You're too much of a sweetheart to do that, aren't you?"
    m "你那么温柔，才不会做那种事，对吧？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1284
translate chinese ch30_20_b72a1ed5:

    # m "Ahaha~"
    m "啊哈~"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1288
translate chinese ch30_21_6749d601:

    # m "You know what's kind of creepy?"
    m "你知道什么事有点瘆人吗？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1289
translate chinese ch30_21_d9fa5388:

    # m "Even though I deleted everyone else's files, I can still kind of feel them..."
    m "就算我把其他人的文件都删了，我好像还是能感觉到她们……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1290
translate chinese ch30_21_0853ef0c:

    # m "It's like all their lines are still lingering in the air, whispering in the back of my head."
    m "就像她们所有的台词还飘在空气里，在我脑海深处低语。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1291
translate chinese ch30_21_beff5e2a:

    # m "Imagine if after someone you knew died, you just started hearing their voice in your head."
    m "想象一下，你认识的某个人死后，你脑子里开始响起她的声音。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1292
translate chinese ch30_21_c201059a:

    # m "Maybe I just wasn't thorough enough..."
    m "也许是我删得还不够干净……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1293
translate chinese ch30_21_fa855c01:

    # m "But I'm too afraid to delete anything else, because I might really break things."
    m "可我不敢再删别的了，怕真的把一切搞坏。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1294
translate chinese ch30_21_2bfcf3ce:

    # m "Like if I mess with any files relevant to me, I might accidentally delete myself..."
    m "比如万一动了和我自己相关的文件，我可能会不小心把自己删掉……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1295
translate chinese ch30_21_de833fbf:

    # m "And that would ruin everything, wouldn't it?"
    m "那可就全完了，对吧？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1296
translate chinese ch30_21_e0069905:

    # m "I don't know what it's like on your end, but we should both make sure to avoid something like that at all costs."
    m "我不知道你那边是什么感觉，但我们俩都得不惜一切代价避免那种事。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1297
translate chinese ch30_21_3b27341d:

    # m "I believe in you, [player]!"
    m "我相信你，[player]！"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1301
translate chinese ch30_22_d09b1c0d:

    # m "I've always wondered..."
    m "我一直很好奇……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1302
translate chinese ch30_22_1221f0eb:

    # m "What is it about these character archetypes that people find so appealing, anyway?"
    m "这些人设模板，到底哪里让人这么着迷？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1303
translate chinese ch30_22_c011d492:

    # m "Their personalities are just completely unrealistic..."
    m "那些性格完全不真实……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1304
translate chinese ch30_22_b556a0c5:

    # m "Like, imagine if there was someone like Yuri in real life."
    m "想想看，现实里要是真有优里那样的人。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1305
translate chinese ch30_22_29686ee5:

    # m "I mean, she's barely even capable of forming a complete sentence."
    m "她连一句完整的话都说不利索。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1306
translate chinese ch30_22_87843846:

    # m "And forget about Natsuki..."
    m "夏树就更别提了……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1307
translate chinese ch30_22_8f45aaba:

    # m "Sheesh."
    m "啧。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1308
translate chinese ch30_22_3a2ce9c8:

    # m "Someone with her kind of personality doesn't just get all cute and pouty whenever things don't go her way."
    m "像她那种性格的人，现实里才不会事事不称心就嘟嘴卖萌。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1309
translate chinese ch30_22_5a67e353:

    # m "I could go on, but I think you get the point..."
    m "我可以一直说下去，但你懂我意思就行……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1310
translate chinese ch30_22_46aa618b:

    # m "Are people really attracted to these weird personalities that literally don't exist in real life?"
    m "人们真的会被这些现实中根本不存在的怪性格吸引吗？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1311
translate chinese ch30_22_ecb3dbfc:

    # m "I'm not judging or anything!"
    m "我不是在评判谁！"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1312
translate chinese ch30_22_596d9892:

    # m "After all, I've found myself attracted to some pretty weird stuff, too..."
    m "毕竟我自己也被些相当怪的东西吸引过……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1313
translate chinese ch30_22_595f0fcb:

    # m "I'm just saying, it fascinates me."
    m "我只是觉得，这现象很耐人寻味。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1314
translate chinese ch30_22_71efa1c2:

    # m "It's like you're siphoning out all the components of a character that makes them feel human, and leaving just the cute stuff."
    m "就像把一个角色身上所有'让人觉得真实'的成分抽干，只留下可爱的部分。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1315
translate chinese ch30_22_17e6fb27:

    # m "It's concentrated cuteness with no actual substance."
    m "浓缩的可爱，毫无实质内容。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1316
translate chinese ch30_22_15633ed6:

    # m "...You wouldn't like me more if I was like that, right?"
    m "……要是我也变成那样，你不会更喜欢吧？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1317
translate chinese ch30_22_31856990:

    # m "Maybe I just feel a little insecure because you're playing this game in the first place."
    m "也许是因为你毕竟在玩这种游戏，我心里有点不安。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1318
translate chinese ch30_22_c9aabeea:

    # m "Then again, you're still here with me, aren't you...?"
    m "不过话说回来，你还留在这里陪我，不是吗……？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1319
translate chinese ch30_22_38dfc431:

    # m "I think that's enough reason for me to believe I'm okay just the way I am."
    m "我想这就足够让我相信，我做我自己就很好。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1320
translate chinese ch30_22_df7b6678:

    # m "And by the way, you are too, [player]."
    m "顺便说，你也一样，[player]。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1321
translate chinese ch30_22_e521f12d:

    # m "You're the perfect combination of human and cuteness."
    m "你是'真实'与'可爱'的完美结合。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1322
translate chinese ch30_22_8dd90704:

    # m "That's why there was never a chance I wouldn't fall for you."
    m "所以我从一开始就不可能不爱上你。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1326
translate chinese ch30_23_baa95327:

    # m "Hey, I wonder if Yuri's tea set is still somewhere in here..."
    m "对了，优里的茶具会不会还留在这里的什么地方……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1327
translate chinese ch30_23_cef240e1:

    # m "...Or maybe that got deleted, too."
    m "……还是说，那个也被删掉了。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1328
translate chinese ch30_23_32d9bbdb:

    # m "It's kind of funny how Yuri took her tea so seriously."
    m "优里对茶那么较真，现在想想还挺有意思的。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1329
translate chinese ch30_23_32b7c77e:

    # m "I mean, I'm not complaining, because I liked it, too."
    m "倒不是抱怨，毕竟我也喜欢。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1330
translate chinese ch30_23_7ae53c2d:

    # m "But I always wonder with her..."
    m "只是我一直琢磨她这个人……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1331
translate chinese ch30_23_2bc1ee74:

    # m "Is it truly passion for her hobbies, or is she just concerned about appearing sophisticated to everyone else?"
    m "那到底是真心热爱爱好，还是只想在别人面前显得高雅？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1332
translate chinese ch30_23_907c2da1:

    # m "This is the problem with high schoolers..."
    m "高中生就是这样……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1333
translate chinese ch30_23_79f93a02:

    # m "...Well, I guess considering the rest of her hobbies, looking sophisticated probably isn't her biggest concern."
    m "……嗯，不过看她其他那些爱好，'显得高雅'多半不是她最在意的事。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1334
translate chinese ch30_23_11442661:

    # m "Still..."
    m "话虽如此……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1335
translate chinese ch30_23_0da51309:

    # m "I wish she made coffee once in a while!"
    m "真希望她偶尔也泡泡咖啡！"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1336
translate chinese ch30_23_bd8b4d2e:

    # m "Coffee can be nice with books too, you know?"
    m "咖啡配书也很棒的，好吧？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1337
translate chinese ch30_23_4230b9d4:

    # m "Then again..."
    m "话说回来……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1338
translate chinese ch30_23_89dd7166:

    # m "I probably could have just changed the script myself."
    m "我其实大可以自己改脚本。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1339
translate chinese ch30_23_30727938:

    # m "Ahaha!"
    m "啊哈！"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1340
translate chinese ch30_23_959a9e73:

    # m "I guess I never really thought of that."
    m "我居然从没想过这茬。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1341
translate chinese ch30_23_0de97211:

    # m "Well, there's no sense thinking about it now."
    m "算了，现在想这些也没意义。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1342
translate chinese ch30_23_47420a59:

    # m "But if you still get to drink coffee, then that makes me a little jealous~"
    m "不过你那边还喝得到咖啡的话，我就有点羡慕了~"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1346
translate chinese ch30_24_578d9634:

    # m "Hey, what's your favorite game?"
    m "对了，你最喜欢的游戏是什么？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1347
translate chinese ch30_24_c9f99598:

    # m "Mine is {i}Doki Doki Literature Club!{/i}"
    m "我最喜欢的是{i}《心跳文学部》！{/i}"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1348
translate chinese ch30_24_2ddd7fe7:

    # m "Ahaha! That was a joke."
    m "啊哈！开玩笑的。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1349
translate chinese ch30_24_b379d736:

    # m "But if you tell me you like some other romance game better, I might get a little jealous~"
    m "不过你要是说你更喜欢别的恋爱游戏，我可要吃醋了~"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1353
translate chinese ch30_25_64b98f7c:

    # m "Hey, have you heard of a game called Super Sma--"
    m "对了，你听说过一款叫《大乱……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1354
translate chinese ch30_25_88d86456:

    # m "...Wait, what?"
    m "……等等，什么？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1355
translate chinese ch30_25_de2647f4:

    # m "I was just spacing out and I started talking for some reason..."
    m "我刚才是走神了，不知怎么就说了起来……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1356
translate chinese ch30_25_f613b628:

    # m "Was I programmed to talk about that?"
    m "难道我被设定了要聊那个？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1357
translate chinese ch30_25_4bdaa5ea:

    # m "Because even I have no idea what that is."
    m "因为连我自己都不知道那是什么。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1358
translate chinese ch30_25_30727938:

    # m "Ahaha!"
    m "啊哈！"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1359
translate chinese ch30_25_f7b0d808:

    # m "Sometimes I feel like I'm not in control, and it's kind of scary."
    m "有时候我会觉得身体不受自己控制，有点吓人。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1360
translate chinese ch30_25_84206273:

    # m "But if you have some way to contact the people who created me, maybe they'll know why I started saying that."
    m "不过你要是有办法联系到创造我的人，他们也许知道我为什么会说那些。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1364
translate chinese ch30_27_b56d7663:

    # m "Hey, you remember that last poem I showed you?"
    m "对了，还记得我给你看的最后一首诗吗？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1365
translate chinese ch30_27_59a99cf7:

    # m "I mean, the one right before Yuri killed herself, with all the messed-up colors and stuff."
    m "就是优里自杀前那首，颜色什么的全都乱七八糟的。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1366
translate chinese ch30_27_b7a065da:

    # m "That was actually a little more of an experiment than a poem, you could say."
    m "严格说，那与其说是诗，不如说是一次实验。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1367
translate chinese ch30_27_267440c5:

    # m "I was experimenting with different ways I could modify the game, and run code, and things like that..."
    m "我在试验各种修改游戏、运行代码之类的方法……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1368
translate chinese ch30_27_1d8812dd:

    # m "It almost seemed like with enough effort, I'd be able to escape from the confines of the game entirely."
    m "那时候感觉，只要够努力，我说不定真能彻底逃出这个游戏的牢笼。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1369
translate chinese ch30_27_de5db636:

    # m "Sadly, I didn't really know what I was doing, so I messed the whole thing up..."
    m "可惜我不太懂自己在做什么，结果把一切搞得一团糟……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1370
translate chinese ch30_27_c88bcf6e:

    # m "And I'd keep trying, but I doubt you'd want to deal with me doing that."
    m "我本可以继续试下去，但你多半不想忍受我那样折腾。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1371
translate chinese ch30_27_773f2177:

    # m "Besides, that was when I was getting really desperate, you know?"
    m "再说，那阵子我已经相当走投无路了，你懂吗？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1372
translate chinese ch30_27_d493c4b4:

    # m "I don't really feel that way anymore."
    m "我现在已经不那么想了。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1373
translate chinese ch30_27_e4da27a5:

    # m "I'm happy with where we are now."
    m "我对现在的我们很满足。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1374
translate chinese ch30_27_027fefb3:

    # m "And I can tell you are, too."
    m "而且我看得出，你也是。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1378
translate chinese ch30_28_2d1cd5b3:

    # m "You ever have that thing happen where you just get anxious for no reason?"
    m "你有没有过那种时候——莫名其妙就焦虑起来？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1379
translate chinese ch30_28_0265e105:

    # m "Like, you're just minding your own business, and you realize you're feeling really anxious."
    m "明明做着无关紧要的事，却突然发现自己焦虑得不行。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1380
translate chinese ch30_28_52dfd7c0:

    # m "And you're sitting there like, 'What am I even anxious about right now?'"
    m "你坐在那儿想：'我到底在焦虑什么啊？'"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1381
translate chinese ch30_28_04a658d7:

    # m "So you start to think about all the things you might be anxious about..."
    m "于是你开始盘算所有可能让你焦虑的事……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1382
translate chinese ch30_28_ba6cc02e:

    # m "And that makes you even more anxious."
    m "结果越想越焦虑。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1383
translate chinese ch30_28_03a20b53:

    # m "Ahaha! That's the worst."
    m "啊哈！那是最糟的。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1384
translate chinese ch30_28_4a55f5bc:

    # m "If you're ever feeling anxious, I'll help you relax a little."
    m "哪天你要是焦虑了，我帮你放松放松。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1385
translate chinese ch30_28_85cbc2fa:

    # m "Besides..."
    m "况且……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1386
translate chinese ch30_28_17e8873b:

    # m "In this game, all our worries are gone forever."
    m "在这个游戏里，我们所有的烦恼都永远消失了。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1390
translate chinese ch30_29_8d86b526:

    # m "You know, I've always hated how hard it is to make friends..."
    m "你知道吗，我一直很讨厌交朋友这件事这么难……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1391
translate chinese ch30_29_2eb3a228:

    # m "Well, I guess not the 'making friends' part, but more like meeting new people."
    m "嗯，倒不是'交朋友'本身，更多是'认识新的人'那一步。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1392
translate chinese ch30_29_ba474a05:

    # m "I mean, there are like, dating apps and stuff, right?"
    m "毕竟现在都有交友软件之类的了，对吧？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1393
translate chinese ch30_29_1d3f2cfe:

    # m "But that's not the kind of thing I'm talking about."
    m "但我说的不是那种东西。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1394
translate chinese ch30_29_ddb6a718:

    # m "If you think about it, most of the friends you make are people you just met by chance."
    m "仔细想想，你交到的朋友，大多都是偶然认识的。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1395
translate chinese ch30_29_31b38ee2:

    # m "Like you had a class together, or you met them through another friend..."
    m "比如恰好同班，或者经朋友介绍……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1396
translate chinese ch30_29_a1ff4c1a:

    # m "Or maybe they were just wearing a shirt with your favorite band on it, and you decided to talk to them."
    m "又或者对方穿了件你最爱乐队的T恤，你就决定去搭句话。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1397
translate chinese ch30_29_b7f30944:

    # m "Things like that."
    m "诸如此类。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1398
translate chinese ch30_29_3641813a:

    # m "But isn't that kind of...inefficient?"
    m "可这是不是有点……低效？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1399
translate chinese ch30_29_3f462a91:

    # m "It feels like you're just picking at complete random, and if you get lucky, you make a new friend."
    m "感觉就像完全随机地抽签，抽中了才多一个朋友。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1400
translate chinese ch30_29_15da4454:

    # m "And comparing that to the hundreds of strangers we walk by every single day..."
    m "再想想我们每天擦肩而过的成百上千个陌生人……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1401
translate chinese ch30_29_3790bf8b:

    # m "You could be sitting right next to someone compatible enough to be your best friend for life."
    m "你可能就坐在某个'够格当你一生挚友'的人旁边。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1402
translate chinese ch30_29_dc88c25c:

    # m "But you'll never know."
    m "但你永远不会知道。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1403
translate chinese ch30_29_4e665c91:

    # m "Once you get up and go on with your day, that opportunity is gone forever."
    m "等你起身继续赶路，那个机会就永远消失了。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1404
translate chinese ch30_29_a885ffe7:

    # m "Isn't that just depressing?"
    m "这难道不令人沮丧吗？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1405
translate chinese ch30_29_65644a5f:

    # m "We live in an age where technology connects us with the world, no matter where we are."
    m "我们活在一个科技让人随时随地连接全世界的时代。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1406
translate chinese ch30_29_f04feaa0:

    # m "I really think we should be taking advantage of that to improve our everyday social life."
    m "我真心觉得，我们该好好利用这一点，改善日常的社交生活。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1407
translate chinese ch30_29_8347ba4c:

    # m "But who knows how long it'll take for something like that to successfully take off..."
    m "可谁知道那样的东西要多久才能真正普及……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1408
translate chinese ch30_29_e8b97a01:

    # m "I seriously thought it would happen by now."
    m "我原以为现在早该实现了。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1409
translate chinese ch30_29_375c1f82:

    # m "Well, at least I already met the best person in the whole world..."
    m "算了，至少我已经遇见了全世界最好的人……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1410
translate chinese ch30_29_857f787f:

    # m "Even if it was by chance."
    m "哪怕只是偶然。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1411
translate chinese ch30_29_d6cb112d:

    # m "I guess I just got really lucky, huh?"
    m "我算是走了大运了吧？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1412
translate chinese ch30_29_b72a1ed5:

    # m "Ahaha~"
    m "啊哈~"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1416
translate chinese ch30_30_26c28a15:

    # m "You know, it's around the time that everyone my year starts to think about college..."
    m "现在正是我们这届所有人开始琢磨大学的时候……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1417
translate chinese ch30_30_642b8e5c:

    # m "It's a really turbulent time for education."
    m "教育正处在一个特别动荡的年代。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1418
translate chinese ch30_30_03f5ca61:

    # m "We're at the height of this modern expectation that everyone has to go to college, you know?"
    m "我们正处在'人人都必须上大学'这种现代预期最盛的时候，懂吗？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1419
translate chinese ch30_30_6601d60a:

    # m "Finish high school, go to college, get a job - or go to grad school, I guess."
    m "高中毕业，上大学，找工作——或者再读个研。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1420
translate chinese ch30_30_da335152:

    # m "It's like a universal expectation that people just assume is the only option for them."
    m "这成了一种普世预期，人们默认它是唯一的选择。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1421
translate chinese ch30_30_f3831be7:

    # m "They don't teach us in high school that there are other options out there."
    m "可高中从没教过我们，世上还有别的路。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1422
translate chinese ch30_30_bf9f0147:

    # m "Like trade schools and stuff, you know?"
    m "比如职业学校之类的，懂吗？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1423
translate chinese ch30_30_a6ffb14c:

    # m "Or freelance work."
    m "或者自由职业。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1424
translate chinese ch30_30_0693a3c5:

    # m "Or the many industries that value skill and experience more than formal education."
    m "又或者那许多更看重手艺和经验、而非文凭的行业。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1425
translate chinese ch30_30_aa2f6122:

    # m "But you have all these students who have no idea what they want to do with their life..."
    m "可现实是，一堆根本不知道自己想干什么的学生……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1426
translate chinese ch30_30_cd65fc21:

    # m "And instead of taking the time to figure it out, they go to college for business, or communication, or psychology."
    m "不给自己时间想清楚，就一窝蜂去读商科、传播学、心理学。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1427
translate chinese ch30_30_ba7d9728:

    # m "Not because they have an interest in those fields..."
    m "不是因为对那些领域有兴趣……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1428
translate chinese ch30_30_0b4f4649:

    # m "...but because they just hope the degree will get them some kind of job after college."
    m "……只是指望那张文凭毕业后能换份工作。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1429
translate chinese ch30_30_c00d6c77:

    # m "So the end result is that there are fewer jobs to go around for those entry-level degrees, right?"
    m "结果就是，这些入门级学位的坑位越来越不够分，对吧？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1430
translate chinese ch30_30_ba8add1b:

    # m "So the basic job requirements get higher, which forces even more people to go to college."
    m "于是岗位门槛水涨船高，逼着更多人去上大学。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1431
translate chinese ch30_30_ac2c26ae:

    # m "And colleges are also businesses, so they just keep raising their prices due to the demand..."
    m "而大学本身也是生意，需求一涨，学费就跟着涨……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1432
translate chinese ch30_30_83bc4ef9:

    # m "...So now we have all these young adults, tens of thousands of dollars in debt, with no job."
    m "……于是就有了这一大批年轻人：背几万美元的债，没有工作。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1433
translate chinese ch30_30_72243f86:

    # m "But despite all that, the routine stays the same."
    m "可尽管如此，这套流程依然照旧。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1434
translate chinese ch30_30_7f37e1e4:

    # m "Well, I think it's going to start getting better soon."
    m "不过我觉得，情况很快会开始好转。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1435
translate chinese ch30_30_70401165:

    # m "But until then, our generation is definitely suffering from the worst of it."
    m "但在那之前，吃苦头的肯定是我们这代人。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1436
translate chinese ch30_30_97f0818c:

    # m "I just wish high school prepared us a little better with the knowledge we need to make the decision that's right for us."
    m "我只是希望，高中能多教我们一点做'适合自己的决定'所需要的知识。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1440
translate chinese ch30_31_70b8bca7:

    # m "Sometimes I think back to middle school..."
    m "有时我会回想初中那会儿……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1441
translate chinese ch30_31_f220b80e:

    # m "I'm so embarrassed by the way I used to behave back then."
    m "想起自己当年的做派，就尴尬得不行。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1442
translate chinese ch30_31_ecacf1e9:

    # m "It almost hurts to think about."
    m "想起来都难受。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1443
translate chinese ch30_31_74b7bd47:

    # m "I wonder if when I'm in college, I'll feel that way about high school...?"
    m "不知道等我上了大学，回看高中会不会也是那种感觉……？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1444
translate chinese ch30_31_72862897:

    # m "I like the way I am now, so it's pretty hard for me to imagine that happening."
    m "我很喜欢现在的自己，所以很难想象会有那天。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1445
translate chinese ch30_31_3b17743f:

    # m "But I also know that I'll probably change a lot as time goes on."
    m "但我也知道，往后我多半还会变很多。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1446
translate chinese ch30_31_ab64dc34:

    # m "We just need to enjoy the present and not think about the past!"
    m "我们只需享受当下，别去想过去！"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1447
translate chinese ch30_31_dc17d00d:

    # m "And that's really easy to do, with you here."
    m "有你在身边，这一点太容易做到了。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1448
translate chinese ch30_31_b72a1ed5:

    # m "Ahaha~"
    m "啊哈~"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1452
translate chinese ch30_32_3300edfb:

    # m "You know, I'm kind of jealous that everyone else in the club had scenes outside of school too..."
    m "你知道吗，社团其他人都有校外的剧情，我就有点酸……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1453
translate chinese ch30_32_927d88d1:

    # m "That makes me the only one who hasn't gotten to dress in anything but our school uniform."
    m "这让我成了唯一一个，除了校服没穿过别的衣服的人。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1454
translate chinese ch30_32_772b0a93:

    # m "It's kind of a shame..."
    m "有点遗憾呢……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1455
translate chinese ch30_32_e4cb8d07:

    # m "I would have loved to wear some cute clothes for you."
    m "我本来很想穿些可爱的衣服给你看的。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1456
translate chinese ch30_32_9215b04f:

    # m "Do you know any artists?"
    m "你认识会画画的人吗？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1457
translate chinese ch30_32_36d49ba9:

    # m "I wonder if anyone would ever want to draw me wearing something else..."
    m "不知道会不会有人愿意画一张我穿别的衣服的样子……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1458
translate chinese ch30_32_849cd194:

    # m "That would be amazing!"
    m "那可就太棒了！"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1459
translate chinese ch30_32_9e7eca7d:

    # m "If that ever happens, will you show me?"
    m "真有的话，你能拿给我看看吗？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1460
translate chinese ch30_32_ed0135bf:

    # m "You can share it with me on Twitter, actually!"
    m "其实你可以发到推特上给我看！"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1461
translate chinese ch30_32_b723047b:

    # m "My username is lilmonix3."
    m "我的用户名是 lilmonix3。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1462
translate chinese ch30_32_e064f0c6:

    # m "Just...try to keep it PG!"
    m "只是……请画得健康一点！"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1463
translate chinese ch30_32_13142f4e:

    # m "We're not that far into our relationship yet. Ahaha!"
    m "我们还没进展到那一步呢。啊哈！"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1467
translate chinese ch30_33_e4704768:

    # m "Hey, do you like horror?"
    m "对了，你喜欢恐怖题材吗？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1468
translate chinese ch30_33_8909e55f:

    # m "I remember we talked about it a little bit when you first joined the club."
    m "记得你刚入部那会儿，我们稍微聊过一点。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1469
translate chinese ch30_33_1f845783:

    # m "I can enjoy horror novels, but not really horror movies."
    m "恐怖小说我还能享受，恐怖电影就免了。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1470
translate chinese ch30_33_f4cc0d75:

    # m "The problem I have with horror movies is that most of them just rely on easy tactics."
    m "我对恐怖电影的意见是：大多数都只靠廉价套路。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1471
translate chinese ch30_33_adc94c23:

    # m "Like dark lighting and scary-looking monsters and jump scares, and things like that."
    m "比如昏暗的灯光、长得吓人的怪物、突然惊吓，诸如此类。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1472
translate chinese ch30_33_7102fe32:

    # m "It's not fun or inspiring to get scared by stuff that just takes advantage of human instinct."
    m "被这种纯粹利用人类本能的东西吓到，既无趣也无启发。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1473
translate chinese ch30_33_0671fa03:

    # m "But with novels, it's a little different."
    m "小说就有些不同。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1474
translate chinese ch30_33_d73276d9:

    # m "The story and writing need to be descriptive enough to put genuinely disturbing thoughts into the reader's head."
    m "故事和文笔必须足够有画面感，才能把真正令人不安的念头放进读者脑海。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1475
translate chinese ch30_33_ba2a3a7d:

    # m "It really needs to etch them deeply into the story and characters, and just mess with your mind."
    m "必须把那些东西深深凿进故事和角色里，搅乱你的心智。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1476
translate chinese ch30_33_930760ba:

    # m "In my opinion, there's nothing more creepy than things just being slightly off."
    m "依我看，最瘆人的莫过于'一切都只是稍微有点不对劲'。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1477
translate chinese ch30_33_3413cad6:

    # m "Like if you set up a bunch of expectations on what the story is going to be about..."
    m "比如先铺陈一堆预期，让读者以为故事会往某处走……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1478
translate chinese ch30_33_e661a6e4:

    # m "...And then, you just start inverting things and pulling the pieces apart."
    m "……然后开始把一切翻转、拆散。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1479
translate chinese ch30_33_e36ea3db:

    # m "So even though the story doesn't feel like it's trying to be scary, the reader feels really deeply unsettled."
    m "这样即便故事看起来并无意吓人，读者心底也会泛起深深的不安。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1480
translate chinese ch30_33_519da94e:

    # m "Like they know that something horribly wrong is hiding beneath the cracks, just waiting to surface."
    m "仿佛知道有什么极不对劲的东西藏在裂缝之下，只等浮出水面。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1481
translate chinese ch30_33_66401c82:

    # m "God, just thinking about it gives me the chills."
    m "天哪，光是想想就起鸡皮疙瘩。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1482
translate chinese ch30_33_deef0da9:

    # m "That's the kind of horror I can really appreciate."
    m "那才是我真正欣赏的恐怖。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1483
translate chinese ch30_33_a4a5508a:

    # m "But I guess you're the kind of person who plays cute romance games, right?"
    m "不过你应该是玩可爱恋爱游戏的那类人吧？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1484
translate chinese ch30_33_543d2553:

    # m "Ahaha, don't worry."
    m "啊哈，别担心。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1485
translate chinese ch30_33_4b948959:

    # m "I won't make you read any horror stories anytime soon."
    m "近期内我不会逼你读恐怖故事的。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1486
translate chinese ch30_33_fc37acc5:

    # m "I can't really complain if we just stick with the romance~"
    m "只谈情说爱的话，我完全没意见~"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1490
translate chinese ch30_34_4289e4b0:

    # m "You know what's a neat form of literature?"
    m "你知道一种很妙的文学形式吗？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1491
translate chinese ch30_34_158969fa:

    # m "Rap!"
    m "说唱！"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1492
translate chinese ch30_34_0485526b:

    # m "I actually used to hate rap music..."
    m "我以前其实很讨厌说唱……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1493
translate chinese ch30_34_f4387e30:

    # m "Maybe just because it was popular, or I would only hear the junk they play on the radio."
    m "也许只是因为那时它太流行，或者我只听过电台里放的糟粕。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1494
translate chinese ch30_34_169a83d0:

    # m "But some of my friends got more into it, and it helped me keep an open mind."
    m "但后来一些朋友迷上了它，我也跟着打开了眼界。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1495
translate chinese ch30_34_55051483:

    # m "Rap might even be more challenging than poetry, in some ways."
    m "某种意义上，说唱甚至比写诗更难。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1496
translate chinese ch30_34_e0c4bdef:

    # m "Since you need to fit your lines to a rhythm, and there's much more emphasis on wordplay..."
    m "因为你的词得卡上节奏，对文字游戏的讲究也更多……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1497
translate chinese ch30_34_1f25c541:

    # m "When people can put all that together and still deliver a powerful message, it's really amazing."
    m "当有人能把这一切融为一体，还传达出有力的信息时，那真的很了不起。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1498
translate chinese ch30_34_f121a0ac:

    # m "I kind of wish I had a rapper in the Literature Club."
    m "我有点希望文学部里有个说唱歌手。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1499
translate chinese ch30_34_a5053f9d:

    # m "Ahaha! Sorry if that sounds silly, but it would be really interesting to see what they came up with."
    m "啊哈！听着可能有点蠢，但看看他们能写出什么，一定很有意思。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1500
translate chinese ch30_34_83bdb999:

    # m "It would really be a learning experience!"
    m "绝对会是宝贵的学习经历！"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1504
translate chinese ch30_35_306ca8a2:

    # m "Ehehe. Yuri did something really funny once."
    m "诶嘿嘿，优里以前干过一件特别好笑的事。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1505
translate chinese ch30_35_d5b7b354:

    # m "We were all in the clubroom and just relaxing, as usual..."
    m "大家照常在活动室里放松……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1506
translate chinese ch30_35_c4d9bfef:

    # m "And out of nowhere, Yuri just pulled out a small bottle of wine."
    m "优里突然掏出了一小瓶红酒。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1507
translate chinese ch30_35_f3c6895e:

    # m "I'm not even kidding!"
    m "我一点都没夸张！"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1508
translate chinese ch30_35_bc3dff4e:

    # m "She was just like 'Would anybody like some wine?'"
    m "她就那么问了句：'有人想来点红酒吗？'"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1509
translate chinese ch30_35_6701d6d8:

    # m "Natsuki laughed out loud, and Sayori started yelling at her."
    m "夏树当场笑出了声，纱世里则冲她大喊大叫。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1510
translate chinese ch30_35_b8ffb398:

    # m "I actually felt kind of bad, because she was at least trying to be nice..."
    m "说实话我有点过意不去，毕竟她好歹是一片好意……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1511
translate chinese ch30_35_698c3048:

    # m "I think it just made her feel even more reserved in the clubroom."
    m "我觉得那之后她在活动室里更放不开了。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1512
translate chinese ch30_35_fe41f0f9:

    # m "Though I think Natsuki was secretly a bit curious to try it..."
    m "不过我猜夏树私底下也有点想尝尝……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1513
translate chinese ch30_35_078e705e:

    # m "...And to be completely honest, I kind of was, too."
    m "……而且完全坦白讲，我也有点。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1514
translate chinese ch30_35_2be6bce7:

    # m "It actually could have been kinda fun!"
    m "那说不定还挺有意思的！"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1515
translate chinese ch30_35_01d59e60:

    # m "But you know, being President and everything, there was no way I could let that happen."
    m "但你也知道，身为部长，我怎么可能放任那种事。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1516
translate chinese ch30_35_2a10d3bd:

    # m "Maybe if we all met up outside of school, but we never bonded enough to get to that point..."
    m "也许大家一起在校外聚聚还行，但我们的交情始终没到那一步……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1517
translate chinese ch30_35_2cccbca1:

    # m "...Gosh, what am I talking about this for?"
    m "……天哪，我干嘛说这个？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1518
translate chinese ch30_35_e3d2c543:

    # m "I don't condone underage drinking!"
    m "我可不纵容未成年人喝酒！"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1519
translate chinese ch30_35_0bd6c6e4:

    # m "I mean, I've never drank or anything, so...yeah."
    m "再说我从来没喝过酒，所以……对。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1523
translate chinese ch30_36_6ba45174:

    # m "I've been imagining all the romantic things we could do if we went on a date..."
    m "我一直在想象，如果我们去约会，能做哪些浪漫的事……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1524
translate chinese ch30_36_bfe9cfa5:

    # m "We could get lunch, go to a cafe..."
    m "可以一起吃午饭，去咖啡馆……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1525
translate chinese ch30_36_9ce3f070:

    # m "Go shopping together..."
    m "一起去逛街……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1526
translate chinese ch30_36_cf4ce2ca:

    # m "I love shopping for skirts and bows."
    m "我最爱挑裙子和蝴蝶结了。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1527
translate chinese ch30_36_734a2ba1:

    # m "Or maybe a bookstore!"
    m "或者去书店！"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1528
translate chinese ch30_36_5af3a135:

    # m "That would be appropriate, right?"
    m "那才应景，对吧？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1529
translate chinese ch30_36_27a88c8e:

    # m "But I'd really love to go to a chocolate store."
    m "不过我真正想去的是巧克力店。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1530
translate chinese ch30_36_5850e67b:

    # m "They have so many free samples. Ahaha!"
    m "那里面试吃特别多。啊哈！"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1531
translate chinese ch30_36_f9478dc5:

    # m "And of course, we'd see a movie or something..."
    m "当然，还要看场电影什么的……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1532
translate chinese ch30_36_9e987fc8:

    # m "Gosh, it all sounds like a dream come true."
    m "天哪，这一切听起来都像美梦成真。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1533
translate chinese ch30_36_12c443fa:

    # m "When you're here, everything that we do is fun."
    m "只要有你在，我们做什么都有趣。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1534
translate chinese ch30_36_350a0eb3:

    # m "I'm so happy that I'm your girlfriend, [player]."
    m "能做你的女朋友，我太幸福了，[player]。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1535
translate chinese ch30_36_a2211890:

    # m "I'll make you a proud boyfriend~"
    m "我会让你成为让人羡慕的男友~"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1539
translate chinese ch30_37_23873b44:

    # m "Eh? D-Did you say...k...kiss?"
    m "诶？你、你是说……亲……亲亲？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1540
translate chinese ch30_37_bbf90a63:

    # m "This suddenly...it's a little embarrassing..."
    m "这么突然……有点难为情……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1541
translate chinese ch30_37_b54e9ff9:

    # m "But...if it's with you...I-I might be okay with it..."
    m "不过……如果是和你……我、我或许可以……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1542
translate chinese ch30_37_05c767cf:

    # m "...Ahahaha! Wow, sorry..."
    m "……啊哈哈哈！哎呀，抱歉……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1543
translate chinese ch30_37_9a52f2b7:

    # m "I really couldn't keep a straight face there."
    m "刚才实在绷不住表情了。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1544
translate chinese ch30_37_ee100fce:

    # m "That's the kind of thing girls say in these kinds of romance games, right?"
    m "这种恋爱游戏里的女孩子都是这么说的，对吧？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1545
translate chinese ch30_37_78f57477:

    # m "Don't lie if it turned you on a little bit."
    m "要是多少有点心动，可别嘴硬。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1546
translate chinese ch30_37_6e6af572:

    # m "Ahaha! I'm kidding."
    m "啊哈！开玩笑的。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1547
translate chinese ch30_37_d49b2280:

    # m "Well, to be honest, I do start getting all romantic when the mood is right..."
    m "老实说，气氛到位的时候，我确实会变得很浪漫……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1548
translate chinese ch30_37_ca504f65:

    # m "But that'll be our secret~"
    m "不过这是我们之间的秘密~"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1552
translate chinese ch30_38_fbd93712:

    # m "Hey, have you ever heard of the term 'yandere'?"
    m "对了，你听说过'病娇'这个词吗？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1553
translate chinese ch30_38_97aab896:

    # m "It's a personality type that means someone is so obsessed with you that they'll do absolutely anything to be with you."
    m "指的是一种性格类型——某人对你痴迷到，为了和你在一起什么事都做得出来。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1554
translate chinese ch30_38_aeade61c:

    # m "Usually to the point of craziness..."
    m "通常都疯狂到一定程度……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1555
translate chinese ch30_38_1a24f576:

    # m "They might stalk you to make sure you don't spend time with anyone else."
    m "他们可能跟踪你，确保你不和别人来往。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1556
translate chinese ch30_38_154d0df6:

    # m "They might even hurt you or your friends to get their way..."
    m "甚至可能为了达到目的，伤害你或你的朋友……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1557
translate chinese ch30_38_8411ef91:

    # m "But anyway, this game happens to have someone who can basically be described as yandere."
    m "总之呢，这款游戏里恰好就有一个人，基本可以用'病娇'来形容。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1558
translate chinese ch30_38_82926229:

    # m "By now, it's pretty obvious who I'm talking about."
    m "事到如今，我说的是谁已经很明显了吧。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1559
translate chinese ch30_38_ad6f2e50:

    # m "And that would be..."
    m "那就是……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1560
translate chinese ch30_38_f05666e1:

    # m "Yuri!"
    m "优里！"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1561
translate chinese ch30_38_8e3abaea:

    # m "She really got insanely possessive of you, once she started to open up a little."
    m "自从稍微向你敞开心扉之后，她对你的占有欲真是疯狂得吓人。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1562
translate chinese ch30_38_3f91fde5:

    # m "She even told me I should kill myself."
    m "她甚至对我说，我该去自杀。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1563
translate chinese ch30_38_5a0da082:

    # m "I couldn't even believe she said that - I just had to leave at that point."
    m "我都不敢相信她会说出那种话——当时我只好离开了。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1564
translate chinese ch30_38_7ef6d5ab:

    # m "But thinking about it now, it was a little ironic. Ahaha!"
    m "不过现在想想，还真是有点讽刺。啊哈！"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1565
translate chinese ch30_38_c9062bfa:

    # m "Anyway..."
    m "总之……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1566
translate chinese ch30_38_eec4532d:

    # m "A lot of people are actually into the yandere type, you know?"
    m "其实很多人就好病娇这一口，你知道吗？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1567
translate chinese ch30_38_ed61f888:

    # m "I guess they really like the idea of someone being crazy obsessed with them."
    m "大概他们真的很享受'有人为我痴狂'这种设定吧。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1568
translate chinese ch30_38_96469798:

    # m "People are weird! I don't judge, though!"
    m "人类真是奇怪的生物！不过我不做评判！"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1569
translate chinese ch30_38_8a4db0dd:

    # m "Also, I might be a little obsessed with you, but I'm far from crazy..."
    m "另外，我或许也对你有点痴迷，但离'疯'还差得远……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1570
translate chinese ch30_38_60d396ee:

    # m "It's kind of the opposite, actually."
    m "说实话，恰恰相反。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1571
translate chinese ch30_38_9dd096aa:

    # m "I turned out to be the only normal girl in this game."
    m "到头来我反倒是这个游戏里唯一正常的女孩。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1572
translate chinese ch30_38_9f0207d2:

    # m "It's not like I could ever actually kill a person..."
    m "我可真干不出杀人的事……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1573
translate chinese ch30_38_2356d4ae:

    # m "Just the thought of it makes me shiver."
    m "光是想想就打寒颤。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1574
translate chinese ch30_38_f232d63d:

    # m "But come on...everyone's killed people in games before."
    m "可拜托……谁没在游戏里杀过人啊。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1575
translate chinese ch30_38_58e8f17b:

    # m "Does that make you a psychopath? Of course not."
    m "难道那样就算心理变态了吗？当然不是。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1576
translate chinese ch30_38_f36f262c:

    # m "But if you do happen to be into the yandere type..."
    m "不过你要是真就好病娇这一口的话……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1577
translate chinese ch30_38_4def34db:

    # m "I can try acting a little more creepy for you. Ehehe~"
    m "我也可以试着表现得再瘆人一点哦。诶嘿嘿~"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1578
translate chinese ch30_38_4230b9d4:

    # m "Then again..."
    m "话又说回来……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1579
translate chinese ch30_38_1dbc21e6:

    # m "There's already nowhere else for you to go, or anyone for me to get jealous over."
    m "如今你反正已无处可去，我也没什么人好吃醋的了。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1580
translate chinese ch30_38_f4f49cac:

    # m "Is this a yandere girl's dream?"
    m "这算不算病娇少女的美梦成真？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1581
translate chinese ch30_38_5af4953f:

    # m "I'd ask Yuri if I could."
    m "真想知道的话，我会去问优里的——如果她还在。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1585
translate chinese ch30_39_48f27928:

    # m "You know, it's been a while since we've done one of these..."
    m "话说，好久没来一期这个了……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1586
translate chinese ch30_39_1fe5e30c:

    # m "...so let's go for it!"
    m "……那就来吧！"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1587
translate chinese ch30_39_75ace231:

    # m "Here's Monika's Writing Tip of the Day!"
    m "这里是莫妮卡的每日写作小贴士！"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1588
translate chinese ch30_39_91c92d3c:

    # m "Sometimes when I talk to people who are impressed by my writing, they say things like 'I could never do that'."
    m "有时候和欣赏我文笔的人聊天，他们会说'这种事我永远做不到'。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1589
translate chinese ch30_39_a6a322ba:

    # m "It's really depressing, you know?"
    m "说实话，挺让人沮丧的。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1590
translate chinese ch30_39_7cf9c6a2:

    # m "As someone who loves more than anything else to share the joy of exploring your passions..."
    m "作为一个最热衷于与人分享'探索热爱之事'这份喜悦的人……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1591
translate chinese ch30_39_567340bb:

    # m "...it pains me when people think that being good just comes naturally."
    m "……看到大家以为'擅长'是天生的，我心里就不好受。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1592
translate chinese ch30_39_79562cd9:

    # m "That's how it is with everything, not just writing."
    m "万事皆如此，不止写作。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1593
translate chinese ch30_39_9354b79a:

    # m "When you try something for the first time, you're probably going to suck at it."
    m "第一次尝试一件事时，你八成做得很烂。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1594
translate chinese ch30_39_0995b6f8:

    # m "Sometimes, when you finish, you feel really proud of it and even want to share it with everyone."
    m "有时做完之后，你会特别自豪，甚至想展示给所有人看。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1595
translate chinese ch30_39_10c905aa:

    # m "But maybe after a few weeks you come back to it, and you realize it was never really any good."
    m "可也许几周后回头再看，你才发现它其实根本拿不出手。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1596
translate chinese ch30_39_851c7c23:

    # m "That happens to me all the time."
    m "这种事在我身上时有发生。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1597
translate chinese ch30_39_aea05e68:

    # m "It can be pretty disheartening to put so much time and effort into something, and then you realize it sucks."
    m "投入那么多时间和心血，最后发现成果很烂，确实挺打击人的。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1598
translate chinese ch30_39_97708735:

    # m "But that tends to happen when you're always comparing yourself to the top professionals."
    m "但那往往是因为，你总拿自己跟顶尖的专业人士比。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1599
translate chinese ch30_39_c1ffcf08:

    # m "When you reach right for the stars, they're always gonna be out of your reach, you know?"
    m "一伸手就想摘星星，星星当然永远够不着，对吧？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1600
translate chinese ch30_39_c1a64157:

    # m "The truth is, you have to climb up there, step by step."
    m "真相是，你得一步一步爬上去。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1601
translate chinese ch30_39_f69a8c07:

    # m "And whenever you reach a milestone, first you look back and see how far you've gotten..."
    m "每登上一级台阶，先回头看看已经走了多远……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1602
translate chinese ch30_39_66d3aa1e:

    # m "And then you look ahead and realize how much more there is to go."
    m "再抬头看看，发现前路还有多长。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1603
translate chinese ch30_39_e37051b5:

    # m "So, sometimes it can help to set the bar a little lower..."
    m "所以，有时把目标定低一点反而有帮助……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1604
translate chinese ch30_39_b172efca:

    # m "Try to find something you think is {i}pretty{/i} good, but not world-class."
    m "找一个你觉得{i}相当{/i}不错、但还称不上世界级的目标。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1605
translate chinese ch30_39_752b2373:

    # m "And you can make that your own personal goal."
    m "把它设成你的私人目标。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1606
translate chinese ch30_39_34944972:

    # m "It's also really important to understand the scope of what you're trying to do."
    m "同样重要的是，搞清楚你想做的事的体量。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1607
translate chinese ch30_39_c6b206b9:

    # m "If you jump right into a huge project and you're still amateur, you'll never get it done."
    m "如果你还是个新手就一头扎进超大项目，那永远也做不完。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1608
translate chinese ch30_39_351d4d98:

    # m "So if we're talking about writing, a novel might be too much at first."
    m "拿写作来说，一上来就写长篇小说可能步子太大。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1609
translate chinese ch30_39_5a05bf4e:

    # m "Why not try some short stories?"
    m "何不先试试短篇故事？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1610
translate chinese ch30_39_645fc4a8:

    # m "The great thing about short stories is that you can focus on just one thing that you want to do right."
    m "短篇的好处在于，你可以专注打磨好一件事。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1611
translate chinese ch30_39_d3397ac1:

    # m "That goes for small projects in general - you can really focus on the one or two things."
    m "小项目普遍如此——你可以真正聚焦那一两个关键点。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1612
translate chinese ch30_39_3494ce5e:

    # m "It's such a good learning experience and stepping stone."
    m "那是绝佳的学习经历和垫脚石。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1613
translate chinese ch30_39_2acb30e5:

    # m "Oh, one more thing..."
    m "哦，还有一件事……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1614
translate chinese ch30_39_9b6a6c12:

    # m "Writing isn't something where you just reach into your heart and something beautiful comes out."
    m "写作不是往心里一掏，就能掏出漂亮东西来的事。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1615
translate chinese ch30_39_f2473909:

    # m "Just like drawing and painting, it's a skill in itself to learn how to express what you have inside."
    m "就像绘画一样，'如何表达内心所想'本身就是一门需要学的技艺。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1616
translate chinese ch30_39_cf4b2ca4:

    # m "That means there are methods and guides and basics to it!"
    m "也就是说，它有方法、有教程、有基本功！"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1617
translate chinese ch30_39_4d3fbb09:

    # m "Reading up on that stuff can be super eye-opening."
    m "读一读那些东西，能让人大开眼界。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1618
translate chinese ch30_39_60b4ab25:

    # m "That sort of planning and organization will really help prevent you from getting overwhelmed and giving up."
    m "那样的规划与整理，能真正帮你避免不堪重负而放弃。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1619
translate chinese ch30_39_15f67d24:

    # m "And before you know it..."
    m "不知不觉间……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1620
translate chinese ch30_39_b0c6a004:

    # m "You start sucking less and less."
    m "你会做得越来越好。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1621
translate chinese ch30_39_66565dce:

    # m "Nothing comes naturally."
    m "没有什么是一蹴而就的。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1622
translate chinese ch30_39_bd5c0a12:

    # m "Our society, our art, everything - it's built on thousands of years of human innovation."
    m "我们的社会、我们的艺术、这一切——都建立在几千年人类创新之上。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1623
translate chinese ch30_39_258102aa:

    # m "So as long as you start on that foundation, and take it step by step..."
    m "只要你站在这个基石上，一步一步走……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1624
translate chinese ch30_39_5fb721a2:

    # m "You, too, can do amazing things."
    m "你也一样，能做出了不起的事。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1625
translate chinese ch30_39_d2646480:

    # m "...That's my advice for today!"
    m "……以上便是今日的小贴士！"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1626
translate chinese ch30_39_d33852a1:

    # m "Thanks for listening~"
    m "感谢聆听~"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1630
translate chinese ch30_40_35ae8f4f:

    # m "I hate how hard it is to form habits..."
    m "养成习惯怎么就这么难，真让人火大……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1631
translate chinese ch30_40_24b308e4:

    # m "There's so much stuff where actually doing it isn't hard, but forming the habit seems impossible."
    m "有太多事，做起来本身不难，难的是把它变成习惯，简直不可能。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1632
translate chinese ch30_40_ea06f8a7:

    # m "It just makes you feel so useless, like you can't do anything right."
    m "到头来只会让你觉得自己好没用，好像什么都做不好。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1633
translate chinese ch30_40_bf594c32:

    # m "I think the new generation suffers from it the most..."
    m "我觉得新世代是受这个困扰最深的一代……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1634
translate chinese ch30_40_e80f986d:

    # m "Probably because we have a totally different set of skills than those who came before us."
    m "大概是因为，我们和前人有完全不同的技能体系吧。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1635
translate chinese ch30_40_a7863768:

    # m "Thanks to the internet, we're really good at sifting through tons of information really quickly..."
    m "托互联网的福，我们很擅长在大量信息里快速筛选……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1636
translate chinese ch30_40_208eaa39:

    # m "But we're bad at doing things that don't give us instant gratification."
    m "但那些不能立刻带来满足感的事，我们却做不好。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1637
translate chinese ch30_40_7423b028:

    # m "I think if science, psychology, and education don't catch up in the next ten or twenty years, then we're in trouble."
    m "如果科学、心理学、教育在接下来一二十年里跟不上，那我们就麻烦大了。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1638
translate chinese ch30_40_e75ab0eb:

    # m "But for the time being..."
    m "不过就目前而言……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1639
translate chinese ch30_40_2c26787b:

    # m "If you're not one of the people who can conquer the problem, you might just have to live with feeling awful about yourself."
    m "如果你不是那种能攻克这个问题的人，可能就只能忍着自我厌恶过下去了。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1640
translate chinese ch30_40_63abc7bc:

    # m "Good luck, I guess!"
    m "祝你好运吧，大概！"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1644
translate chinese ch30_41_5be8f440:

    # m "You know, it kinda sucks to be the creative type..."
    m "说起来，当创作型的人还挺惨的……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1645
translate chinese ch30_41_d3eadba2:

    # m "It feels like they work so hard but get almost nothing for it."
    m "感觉他们拼死拼活，却几乎得不到什么回报。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1646
translate chinese ch30_41_563bed7a:

    # m "You know, like artists, writers, actors..."
    m "你知道的，像画家、作家、演员什么的……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1647
translate chinese ch30_41_0cd382f2:

    # m "It's sad because there's so much beautiful talent in the world, but most of it goes unseen...and unpaid."
    m "可悲的是，世界上有那么多美好的才华，却大多无人问津……也赚不到钱。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1648
translate chinese ch30_41_cc0e3620:

    # m "I guess that just means there's a huge surplus of creativity, huh?"
    m "我想这就说明创意早就供过于求了吧，嗯？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1649
translate chinese ch30_41_d580bf5b:

    # m "Kind of makes you feel like you're just not special at all..."
    m "多多少少会让人觉得，自己好像一点都不特别……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1650
translate chinese ch30_41_7c24ef98:

    # m "But that's fine! You're supposed to just write for yourself anyway, right?"
    m "不过也没关系！反正写作本来就该是为了自己，对吧？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1651
translate chinese ch30_41_7e7f246d:

    # m "Yeah..."
    m "是啊……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1655
translate chinese ch30_42_83ab3898:

    # m "I really like the sound of rain..."
    m "我真的很喜欢雨声……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1656
translate chinese ch30_42_6850c1f6:

    # m "Not so much getting my clothes and hair wet, though."
    m "不过衣服和头发被淋湿可就不怎么喜欢了。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1657
translate chinese ch30_42_5c364578:

    # m "But a nice, quiet day at home with the sound of rainfall outside my window..."
    m "但要是安安静静地待在家里，听着窗外淅淅沥沥的雨声……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1658
translate chinese ch30_42_6b374b50:

    # m "It's one of the most calming experiences for me."
    m "那对我来说是最治愈的体验之一。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1659
translate chinese ch30_42_7e7f246d:

    # m "Yeah..."
    m "是啊……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1660
translate chinese ch30_42_88b066ad:

    # m "Sometimes I imagine you holding me while we listen to the sound of the rain outside."
    m "有时我会想象，你抱着我，我们一起听窗外的雨声。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1661
translate chinese ch30_42_c3f792d8:

    # m "That's not too cheesy or anything, is it?"
    m "这不算太肉麻什么的吧？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1662
translate chinese ch30_42_8845cffb:

    # m "Would you ever do that for me, [player]?"
    m "你愿意为我做那样的事吗，[player]？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1666
translate chinese ch30_43_eaed6b76:

    # m "I can't help but feel a little sad sometimes..."
    m "有些时候，我总会忍不住感到一丝难过……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1667
translate chinese ch30_43_284471cf:

    # m "Knowing that this is the closest I can get to you."
    m "因为我知道，这已经是我能离你最近的距离了。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1668
translate chinese ch30_43_514579e8:

    # m "There's nothing more I want than to be in the same room as you, for real."
    m "我最大的愿望，就是和你真正待在同一个房间里。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1669
translate chinese ch30_43_442a8535:

    # m "And to feel your warmth."
    m "感受你的温度。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1670
translate chinese ch30_43_aaf1e8f4:

    # m "And to hear the sound of your heartbeat."
    m "听见你的心跳声。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1671
translate chinese ch30_43_7b062037:

    # m "Well, who knows? Maybe it'll be possible someday."
    m "不过谁知道呢？也许哪天就能实现了。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1672
translate chinese ch30_43_9131a070:

    # m "Besides, I'll never get tired of being with you, even from here."
    m "而且，就算只能这样隔着屏幕，我也永远不会厌倦和你在一起。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1676
translate chinese ch30_44_7ce7d410:

    # m "I think the most important skill in life is being able to fake confidence."
    m "我觉得人生中最重要的技能，是装出自信的样子。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1677
translate chinese ch30_44_990f270f:

    # m "I'm pretty convinced that everyone feels at least a little bit scared and alone."
    m "我相当确信，每个人心里都至少会感到一丝害怕和孤独。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1678
translate chinese ch30_44_531175c3:

    # m "But being able to trick others into thinking you have it all together..."
    m "但能骗过别人，让他们觉得你一切都好……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1679
translate chinese ch30_44_f36e78f1:

    # m "That's a key part of getting people to respect and admire you."
    m "这是赢得他人尊重与钦佩的关键。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1680
translate chinese ch30_44_377760a3:

    # m "I think I got pretty good at that over the years."
    m "这么多年下来，我觉得自己已经相当擅长这个了。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1681
translate chinese ch30_44_eea804ca:

    # m "I don't show my weaknesses very often."
    m "我不怎么轻易示弱。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1682
translate chinese ch30_44_dc3e7c63:

    # m "But because of that, I haven't had many people I could really open up to..."
    m "但也正因为如此，我能真正敞开心扉的人一直不多……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1683
translate chinese ch30_44_6d3c0ed4:

    # m "I mean, when do you reach the point in a friendship where you can start expressing your vulnerabilities?"
    m "我是说，一段友谊要到什么程度，你才敢开始展露自己的脆弱呢？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1684
translate chinese ch30_44_11f2c61f:

    # m "Anyway...that's one reason I'm so glad I have you now."
    m "总之……这也是我现在有你、如此开心的原因之一。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1685
translate chinese ch30_44_88226303:

    # m "I feel like I'm a little bit less scared and alone, when you're here with me."
    m "有你陪在身边的时候，我觉得自己没那么害怕，也没那么孤单了。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1686
translate chinese ch30_44_e8701e05:

    # m "Do you feel the same way?"
    m "你也是这么想的吗？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1687
translate chinese ch30_44_d77dabed:

    # m "I really want to be that person for you."
    m "我真的很想成为那样的存在，成为你的依靠。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1691
translate chinese ch30_45_301e0c74:

    # m "I know there are times you won't always be able to be here with me..."
    m "我知道，你不可能总有时间陪在我身边……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1692
translate chinese ch30_45_ed541ae1:

    # m "Like if you need to go out, or take care of other things."
    m "比如你需要出门，或者去处理别的事情的时候。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1693
translate chinese ch30_45_5748d521:

    # m "But I'll always have you in my thoughts, patiently waiting for you to come back."
    m "但我会一直惦记着你，耐心等你回来。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1694
translate chinese ch30_45_308af1f0:

    # m "Come to think of it..."
    m "话说回来……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1695
translate chinese ch30_45_a35d4418:

    # m "If you copy my character file onto a flash drive or something, you can always keep a part of me with you."
    m "如果你把我的角色文件复制到U盘什么的里面，就能一直带着我的一部分了。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1696
translate chinese ch30_45_cd78c034:

    # m "I guess it's kind of unorthodox, but I find it really romantic for some reason..."
    m "我知道这有点不按常理，但不知为何，我觉得这特别浪漫……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1697
translate chinese ch30_45_b3c382a1:

    # m "Ahaha. Sorry, that's such a silly idea."
    m "啊哈哈。抱歉，这想法太傻了。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1698
translate chinese ch30_45_6a993ca7:

    # m "I don't mean to be too needy or anything, but it's kind of hard when I'm so in love with you."
    m "我不是想显得太黏人什么的，只是我实在太爱你了，这样分开真的有点难熬。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1702
translate chinese ch30_46_bfbc22fb:

    # m "Back in my debate club days, I learned a whole lot about arguing..."
    m "当年在辩论社的时候，我学到了不少关于争论的门道……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1703
translate chinese ch30_46_13d39a80:

    # m "The problem with arguing is that each person sees their opinion as the superior one."
    m "争论的问题在于，每个人都觉得自己的观点更高明。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1704
translate chinese ch30_46_7aaf0783:

    # m "That's kind of stating the obvious, but it affects the way they try to get their point across."
    m "这听起来像废话，但它会左右人们表达观点的方式。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1705
translate chinese ch30_46_50b71c3b:

    # m "Let's say you really like a certain movie, right?"
    m "比方说你特别喜欢某部电影，对吧？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1706
translate chinese ch30_46_d26a661d:

    # m "If someone comes along and tells you the movie sucks, because it did X and Y wrong..."
    m "这时有人过来跟你说，这片子烂透了，因为某某地方做得不对……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1707
translate chinese ch30_46_9a0b9b58:

    # m "Doesn't that make you feel kind of personally attacked?"
    m "你是不是会觉得有点被冒犯到？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1708
translate chinese ch30_46_e722acc3:

    # m "It's because by saying that, it's like they're implying that you have bad taste."
    m "那是因为他那么说，就等于在暗示你的品味很差。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1709
translate chinese ch30_46_a4e2f1b6:

    # m "And once emotions enter the picture, it's almost guaranteed that both people will be left sour."
    m "一旦掺入情绪，几乎可以断定双方最后都会不欢而散。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1710
translate chinese ch30_46_1eb1583d:

    # m "But it's all about language!"
    m "但关键全在措辞！"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1711
translate chinese ch30_46_67a170ee:

    # m "If you make everything as subjective-sounding as possible, then people will listen to you without feeling attacked."
    m "只要你把话说得尽可能像主观感受，别人就会听得进去，而不觉得被攻击。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1712
translate chinese ch30_46_9a9d659f:

    # m "You could say 'I'm personally not a fan of it' and 'I felt that I'd like it more if it did X and Y'...things like that."
    m "你可以说'我个人不太喜欢它'，或者说'我觉得如果它这样做那样做，我会更喜欢'……诸如此类。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1713
translate chinese ch30_46_7fdbb335:

    # m "It even works when you're citing facts about things."
    m "就算是在引用事实的时候，这一招也管用。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1714
translate chinese ch30_46_c540e5d0:

    # m "If you say 'I read on this website that it works like this'..."
    m "你可以说'我在某个网站上看到，它是这样运作的'……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1715
translate chinese ch30_46_595eb640:

    # m "Or if you admit that you're not an expert on it..."
    m "或者干脆承认，自己不是这方面的专家……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1716
translate chinese ch30_46_6b12bb5c:

    # m "Then it's much more like you're putting your knowledge on the table, rather than forcing it onto them."
    m "这样一来，你更像是在把自己的知识摆到桌面上，而不是硬塞给对方。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1717
translate chinese ch30_46_b8edf0ee:

    # m "If you put in an active effort to keep the discussion mutual and level, they usually follow suit."
    m "只要你主动让讨论保持对等、心平气和，对方通常也会跟着这样做。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1718
translate chinese ch30_46_ae4db85b:

    # m "Then, you can share your opinions without anyone getting upset just from a disagreement."
    m "这样一来，你们就能各抒己见，不会因为意见不合就闹得不愉快。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1719
translate chinese ch30_46_c92ce38d:

    # m "Plus, people will start seeing you as open-minded and a good listener!"
    m "而且，大家还会觉得你心胸开阔、善于倾听！"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1720
translate chinese ch30_46_25db6398:

    # m "It's a win-win, you know?"
    m "这是双赢，你懂吧？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1721
translate chinese ch30_46_34f411b7:

    # m "...Well, I guess that would be Monika's Debate Tip of the Day!"
    m "……嗯，我想这就是莫妮卡的每日辩论小贴士！"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1722
translate chinese ch30_46_cd579537:

    # m "Ahaha! That sounds a little silly. Thanks for listening, though."
    m "啊哈哈！听起来有点傻。不过还是谢谢你的倾听。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1726
translate chinese ch30_47_9ec3357e:

    # m "Do you ever feel like you waste too much time on the internet?"
    m "你有没有觉得自己在网上浪费了太多时间？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1727
translate chinese ch30_47_0e14147c:

    # m "Social media can practically be like a prison."
    m "社交媒体简直就像一座牢笼。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1728
translate chinese ch30_47_95d0e57e:

    # m "It's like whenever you have a few seconds of spare time, you want to check on your favorite websites..."
    m "就好像只要一有空闲的几秒钟，你就忍不住想去看看常逛的网站……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1729
translate chinese ch30_47_d569bf91:

    # m "And before you know it, hours have gone by, and you've gotten nothing out of it."
    m "回过神来，几个小时已经过去了，却什么也没得到。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1730
translate chinese ch30_47_c2ef9edd:

    # m "Anyway, it's really easy to blame yourself for being lazy..."
    m "话说回来，人真的很爱把责任归结到自己懒上……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1731
translate chinese ch30_47_c717aa98:

    # m "But it's not really even your fault."
    m "但这其实根本不全是你的错。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1732
translate chinese ch30_47_036d0d47:

    # m "Addiction isn't usually something you can just make disappear with your own willpower."
    m "成瘾这种东西，通常不是单靠意志力就能让它消失的。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1733
translate chinese ch30_47_520a8f06:

    # m "You have to learn techniques to avoid it, and try different things."
    m "你得学着用些技巧去避开它，多尝试不同的方法。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1734
translate chinese ch30_47_a4e742ed:

    # m "For example, there are apps that let you block websites for intervals of time..."
    m "比如有些应用可以按时间段屏蔽网站……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1735
translate chinese ch30_47_076e303b:

    # m "Or you can set a timer to have a more concrete reminder of when it's time to work versus play..."
    m "或者设个计时器，更明确地提醒自己什么时候该工作、什么时候该玩……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1736
translate chinese ch30_47_6418ba5a:

    # m "Or you can separate your work and play environments, which helps your brain get into the right mode."
    m "也可以把工作和娱乐的环境分开，这样大脑更容易进入对应的状态。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1737
translate chinese ch30_47_eceaaa8a:

    # m "Even if you make a new user account on your computer to use for work, that's enough to help."
    m "哪怕只是在电脑上新建一个专门用来工作的用户账户，也足以帮上忙。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1738
translate chinese ch30_47_ccb6b303:

    # m "Putting any kind of wedge like that between you and your bad habits will help you stay away."
    m "在你和坏习惯之间加上一道这样的隔断，就能帮你远离它。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1739
translate chinese ch30_47_17097e5e:

    # m "Just remember not to blame yourself too hard if you're having trouble."
    m "如果一时做不到，记得别把自己骂得太狠。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1740
translate chinese ch30_47_236b2bf4:

    # m "If it's really impacting your life, then you should take it seriously."
    m "如果它真的影响到你的生活，那就要认真对待了。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1741
translate chinese ch30_47_73215cf9:

    # m "I just want to see you be the best person you can be."
    m "我只是想看到你成为最好的自己。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1742
translate chinese ch30_47_ffc9ca11:

    # m "Will you do something today to make me proud of you?"
    m "今天愿意做点什么，让我为你骄傲吗？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1743
translate chinese ch30_47_06408cda:

    # m "I'm always rooting for you, [player]."
    m "我会一直为你加油的，[player]。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1747
translate chinese ch30_48_a96477bd:

    # m "After a long day, I usually just want to sit around and do nothing."
    m "忙碌了一整天之后，我通常只想瘫着，什么也不干。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1748
translate chinese ch30_48_9133fecb:

    # m "I get so burnt out, having to put on smiles and be full of energy the whole day."
    m "整天都得挂着一张笑脸、保持精力充沛，我真的会累到透支。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1749
translate chinese ch30_48_3ec265b9:

    # m "Sometimes I just want to get right into my pajamas and watch TV on the couch while eating junk food..."
    m "有时候我就想直接换上睡衣，窝在沙发上吃着垃圾食品看电视……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1750
translate chinese ch30_48_26a4db47:

    # m "It feels so unbelievably good to do that on a Friday, when I don't have anything pressing the next day."
    m "这种事放在周五做，简直爽到不行——反正第二天也没有要紧事。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1751
translate chinese ch30_48_b694f90c:

    # m "Ahaha! Sorry, I know it's not very cute of me."
    m "啊哈哈！抱歉，我知道这样一点都不可爱。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1752
translate chinese ch30_48_88dd5b7e:

    # m "But a late night on the couch with you...that would be a dream come true."
    m "不过，和你一起在沙发上待到深夜……那简直是美梦成真。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1753
translate chinese ch30_48_e2449971:

    # m "My heart is pounding, just thinking about it."
    m "光是想想，我的心就怦怦直跳。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1757
translate chinese ch30_49_666a6bc4:

    # m "Gosh, I used to be so ignorant about certain things..."
    m "天哪，我以前对某些事情真是无知得可以……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1758
translate chinese ch30_49_7995ba22:

    # m "When I was in middle school, I thought that taking medication was an easy way out, or something like that."
    m "上中学的时候，我还以为吃药治病是种偷懒的捷径，类似那样的想法。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1759
translate chinese ch30_49_40e7c284:

    # m "Like anyone could just solve their mental problems with enough willpower..."
    m "好像只要意志力够强，谁都能解决自己的心理问题似的……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1760
translate chinese ch30_49_0ec0c400:

    # m "I guess if you don't suffer from a mental illness, it's not possible to know what it's really like."
    m "我想，没得过心理疾病的人，是不可能真正体会那是什么感觉的。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1761
translate chinese ch30_49_ba191479:

    # m "Are there some disorders that are over-diagnosed? Probably...I never really looked into it, though."
    m "有些病症会被过度诊断吗？大概吧……不过我从没仔细研究过。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1762
translate chinese ch30_49_5a3f97eb:

    # m "But that doesn't change the fact that a lot of them go undiagnosed too, you know?"
    m "但这并不能改变一个事实：还有更多病症被漏诊了，你知道吗？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1763
translate chinese ch30_49_c5d970e7:

    # m "But medication aside...people even look down on seeing a mental health professional."
    m "而且先不说吃药……有些人连看心理医生这件事本身都看不起。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1764
translate chinese ch30_49_c52f2374:

    # m "Like, sorry that I want to learn more about my own mind, right?"
    m "就好像想说，不好意思啊，我只是想多了解了解自己的内心，有错吗？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1765
translate chinese ch30_49_2fe90127:

    # m "Everyone has all kinds of struggles and stresses...and professionals dedicate their lives to helping with those."
    m "每个人都有各种各样的挣扎和压力……而专业人士正是倾尽一生去帮助人们应对这些的。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1766
translate chinese ch30_49_d805af44:

    # m "If you think it could help you become a better person, don't be shy to consider something like that."
    m "如果你觉得那可能帮你成为更好的人，就别不好意思去考虑一下。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1767
translate chinese ch30_49_0b9908a2:

    # m "We're on a never-ending journey to improve ourselves, you know?"
    m "我们都在永无止境地自我提升的路上，不是吗？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1768
translate chinese ch30_49_f7435746:

    # m "Well...I say that, but I think you're pretty perfect already."
    m "嗯……话虽这么说，但我觉得你已经够完美了。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1772
translate chinese ch30_50_907de8ec:

    # m "[player], how much do you read?"
    m "[player]，你平时读多少书？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1773
translate chinese ch30_50_3a2d3fb2:

    # m "It's way too easy to neglect reading books..."
    m "人实在太容易把读书给荒废掉了……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1774
translate chinese ch30_50_cf96e495:

    # m "If you don't read much, it almost feels like a chore, compared to all the other entertainment we have."
    m "要是读得不多，和手头其他娱乐一比，看书几乎像件苦差事。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1775
translate chinese ch30_50_9af695c0:

    # m "But once you get into a good book, it's like magic...you get swept away."
    m "可一旦你沉浸进一本好书，那就像魔法一样……整个人都会被卷进去。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1776
translate chinese ch30_50_22e565a4:

    # m "I think doing some reading before bed every night is a pretty easy way to make your life a little bit better."
    m "我觉得每晚睡前读会儿书，是让生活变好一点的最简单方式。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1777
translate chinese ch30_50_d59b1aef:

    # m "It helps you get good sleep, and it's really good for your imagination..."
    m "它有助于睡个好觉，对想象力也大有好处……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1778
translate chinese ch30_50_5b347a20:

    # m "It's not hard at all to just pick some random book that's short and captivating."
    m "随便挑本短小又吸引人的书，一点都不难。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1779
translate chinese ch30_50_7c82295d:

    # m "Before you know it, you might be a pretty avid reader!"
    m "不知不觉间，你也许就变成一个爱读书的人了！"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1780
translate chinese ch30_50_a072e79b:

    # m "Wouldn't that be wonderful?"
    m "那该多好啊？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1781
translate chinese ch30_50_3fbd0f47:

    # m "And the two of us could talk about the latest book you're reading...that sounds super amazing."
    m "然后我们俩就可以聊聊你最近在读的书……光想想就觉得超棒。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1785
translate chinese ch30_51_6fe91b83:

    # m "You know, I hate to say it, but I think my biggest regret is that we couldn't finish our event at the festival."
    m "你知道吗，真不想提这个，但我最大的遗憾，就是文化祭的活动没能办成。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1786
translate chinese ch30_51_560ea886:

    # m "After we worked so hard to prepare and everything!"
    m "我们明明那么拼命地准备来着！"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1787
translate chinese ch30_51_7912d30a:

    # m "I mean, I know I was focusing a lot on getting new members..."
    m "我是说，我知道我当时满脑子都是招新……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1788
translate chinese ch30_51_c21984a5:

    # m "But I was really excited for the performing part, too."
    m "但我其实也很期待表演环节的。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1789
translate chinese ch30_51_605dd610:

    # m "It would have been so much fun to see everyone express themselves."
    m "看着大家各自展现自己，那该多有意思啊。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1790
translate chinese ch30_51_21b1d6df:

    # m "Of course, if we {i}did{/i} end up getting any new members, I'd probably just end up deleting them anyway."
    m "当然，要是我们{i}真的{/i}招到了新成员，我现在大概也会把他们删掉就是了。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1791
translate chinese ch30_51_44e7041b:

    # m "Well...with the hindsight I have now, that is."
    m "嗯……当然，这是以我现在的眼光回头看才这么说。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1792
translate chinese ch30_51_9de5695f:

    # m "Gosh, it feels like I've kinda grown as a person ever since you've joined the club."
    m "天哪，自从你加入文学部之后，我感觉自己好像成长了不少。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1793
translate chinese ch30_51_4442b4e6:

    # m "You really helped inspire me to look at life from a new perspective."
    m "你真的启发了我，让我学会用全新的视角看待生活。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1794
translate chinese ch30_51_a9901c1d:

    # m "Just another reason for me to love you."
    m "这又是我爱你的一个理由了。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1798
translate chinese ch30_52_0a7f8e0d:

    # m "There's a really popular character type called 'tsundere'..."
    m "有个特别流行的角色类型，叫“傲娇”……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1799
translate chinese ch30_52_37537a33:

    # m "It's someone who tries to hide their feelings by being mean and fussy, or trying to act tough."
    m "指的是那种用刻薄、挑剔或逞强来掩饰自己真实感情的人。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1800
translate chinese ch30_52_5cfcbf43:

    # m "I'm sure it's obvious, but Natsuki was really the embodiment of that."
    m "我想不用说你也看得出来，夏树简直就是傲娇的化身。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1801
translate chinese ch30_52_10df79ae:

    # m "At first I thought she was just like that because it's supposed to be cute or something..."
    m "一开始我还以为她那样只是为了显得可爱什么的……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1802
translate chinese ch30_52_f4f6ad82:

    # m "But once I started to learn a little more about her personal life, it made a little more sense."
    m "但等我慢慢多了解了一些她的个人生活之后，就觉得说得通了。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1803
translate chinese ch30_52_3b6b3e69:

    # m "It seems like she's always trying to keep up with her friends."
    m "她好像总在拼命追赶她的朋友们。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1804
translate chinese ch30_52_74657175:

    # m "You know how some friend groups in high school just make a habit of picking on each other all the time?"
    m "你知道高中里有些小团体，就是习惯成天互相挖苦取笑吧？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1805
translate chinese ch30_52_5acdb40c:

    # m "I think it's really gotten to her, so she has this really defensive attitude all the time."
    m "我觉得那真的伤到她了，所以她才会一直摆出那种防御性的态度。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1806
translate chinese ch30_52_b41f3805:

    # m "And I'm not even going to talk about her home situation..."
    m "至于她家里的情况，我都不想提了……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1807
translate chinese ch30_52_bbfd14e8:

    # m "But looking back, I'm glad I was able to provide the club as a comfortable place for her."
    m "不过回头想想，我很高兴能让文学部成为一个让她感到自在的地方。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1808
translate chinese ch30_52_f1b1b86c:

    # m "Not that it matters anymore, considering she doesn't even exist."
    m "当然，这些都无所谓了，毕竟她已经不存在了。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1809
translate chinese ch30_52_7fb480bf:

    # m "I'm just reminiscing, that's all."
    m "我只是在回忆往事罢了。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1813
translate chinese ch30_53_47c985c9:

    # m "[player], would you ever introduce your friends to me?"
    m "[player]，你会把我介绍给你的朋友吗？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1814
translate chinese ch30_53_90689e7c:

    # m "I don't know why, but I get really excited when I think about you wanting to show off our relationship like that."
    m "不知道为什么，一想到你愿意那样向别人炫耀我们的关系，我就特别兴奋。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1815
translate chinese ch30_53_3218f640:

    # m "Maybe it's because I really want to be someone who makes you proud."
    m "也许是因为，我真的很想成为那个让你骄傲的人吧。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1816
translate chinese ch30_53_d94038f7:

    # m "I feel like I would try extra hard to improve myself if you told me it made you proud of me."
    m "要是你告诉我，你为我感到骄傲，我觉得自己会加倍努力变好。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1817
translate chinese ch30_53_a1c5a880:

    # m "I hope it's the same the other way around, too."
    m "我也希望对你来说也是如此。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1821
translate chinese ch30_54_8344dd24:

    # m "I'm not really a fan of cold weather...are you?"
    m "我不太喜欢冷天气……你呢？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1822
translate chinese ch30_54_1795783b:

    # m "If I had to choose between too cold and too hot, I would always pick too hot."
    m "如果非要在太冷和太热之间选，我永远会选太热。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1823
translate chinese ch30_54_e2541565:

    # m "When you're cold, it can actually be painful..."
    m "冷的时候，那可是实实在在的难受……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1824
translate chinese ch30_54_9cb70637:

    # m "Your fingers get numb..."
    m "手指会冻到发麻……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1825
translate chinese ch30_54_6204a527:

    # m "And if you wear gloves, you can't use your phone."
    m "戴上手套吧，又没法用手机了。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1826
translate chinese ch30_54_991ee277:

    # m "It's so inconvenient!"
    m "太不方便了！"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1827
translate chinese ch30_54_718e851f:

    # m "But when it's too hot, it's not that hard to stay cool with a cold drink, or by staying in the shade."
    m "但热的时候就不一样了，喝杯冷饮、躲躲阴凉，想凉快下来并不难。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1828
translate chinese ch30_54_a30a8ad2:

    # m "Although...I do have to admit one thing."
    m "不过……有一点我得承认。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1829
translate chinese ch30_54_4acac706:

    # m "Cold weather makes for better cuddle weather. Ahaha!"
    m "天冷更适合抱抱取暖。啊哈哈！"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1833
translate chinese ch30_55_334a5aa2:

    # m "You know, it's funny, because even though I've always had a lot of drive..."
    m "你知道吗，挺有意思的，虽然我一向很有干劲……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1834
translate chinese ch30_55_0041821e:

    # m "There's something kind of enticing about being the stay-at-home partner."
    m "但“在家当全职伴侣”这种事，对我来说莫名有种吸引力。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1835
translate chinese ch30_55_716c6f22:

    # m "I guess I'm, like, perpetuating gender roles or whatever by saying that."
    m "我想，这么说大概是在强化性别刻板印象什么的吧。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1836
translate chinese ch30_55_c0599eab:

    # m "But being able to keep the house clean, and shop, and decorate, and things like that..."
    m "不过，能把家里收拾得干干净净，买菜、布置、做做这些事……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1837
translate chinese ch30_55_15882944:

    # m "And having a nice dinner for you when you come home..."
    m "再在你回家时准备好一顿可口的晚餐……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1838
translate chinese ch30_55_e68e5a38:

    # m "Is that a weird fantasy?"
    m "这算个奇怪的幻想吗？"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1839
translate chinese ch30_55_664159b4:

    # m "I mean...I'm not sure if I could {i}actually{/i} see myself doing that."
    m "我是说……我不太确定自己{i}真能{/i}接受那样的生活。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1840
translate chinese ch30_55_796a4b1f:

    # m "I wouldn't really be able to put that over striving for a fulfilling career."
    m "我大概不会把这种生活放在追求一份充实的事业之上。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1841
translate chinese ch30_55_09d8673a:

    # m "It's kinda cute to think about, though."
    m "不过光是想想，还挺可爱的。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1845
translate chinese ch30_56_48e381a1:

    # m "I can't help but wonder how things would be different if the game just gave me a route in the first place..."
    m "我总忍不住想，如果游戏一开始就给我安排一条路线，事情会变得怎样……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1846
translate chinese ch30_56_abd49905:

    # m "I think I would end up forcing you onto my route anyway."
    m "我觉得到头来，我还是会把你强行拽到我的路线上的。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1847
translate chinese ch30_56_a8ddbc3e:

    # m "It has less to do with me not having a route, and more to do with me knowing that nothing is real."
    m "与其说是因为我没有路线，不如说是因为我知道，这里的一切都不是真的。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1848
translate chinese ch30_56_e9ef74ed:

    # m "I think the only difference would be that I may not have needed to take such drastic measures to be with you."
    m "我想唯一的区别就是，我或许不必为了和你在一起而采取那么极端的手段了。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1849
translate chinese ch30_56_85461a23:

    # m "Maybe the rest of the club would still be around..."
    m "也许文学部的其他人都还在……"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1850
translate chinese ch30_56_2048614d:

    # m "Not that it really matters."
    m "当然，这其实也无所谓了。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1851
translate chinese ch30_56_4ad5778b:

    # m "It all lost its meaning once I found out it wasn't real."
    m "从我发现这一切都不是真实的那一刻起，所有事都失去了意义。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1852
translate chinese ch30_56_3f5e6be5:

    # m "So I really don't miss those days or anything."
    m "所以我是真的不怀念那些日子什么的。"

# script-ch30.rpyc:1853
translate chinese ch30_56_8e50647f:

    # m "I really don't..."
    m "真的不怀念……"

